<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:05.200" end="00:00:09.900" style="s2">The CEO of Graytech is marrying into one</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.300" end="00:00:11.100" style="s2">of those billionaire families.</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.900" end="00:00:13.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve seen that watch on a magazine</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.100" end="00:00:15.900" style="s2">cover. It cost a fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.000" end="00:00:15.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a Patek Philippe.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.800" end="00:00:21.800" style="s2">Galen, what did you do? Why is the</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.900" end="00:00:23.200" style="s2">engagement off? Keep this up and I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.800" end="00:00:24.900" style="s2">put Nate in your place.</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.200" end="00:00:26.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one takes what&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.900" end="00:00:29.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you talk to me like that, you</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.600" end="00:00:29.400" style="s2">useless idiot?</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.900" end="00:00:42.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.300" end="00:00:44.300" style="s2">You dropped your bread.</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.400" end="00:00:46.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.300" end="00:00:49.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean you&#39;re throwing it away?</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.600" end="00:00:49.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.100" end="00:00:54.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would you mind if I had it?</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.200" end="00:00:56.700" style="s2">My boyfriend&#39;s proposing to me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.800" end="00:00:59.400" style="s2">I spent all my money</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.700" end="00:01:01.600" style="s2">on a gift for him.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.400" end="00:01:03.000" style="s2">I found this lucky coin by the fountain</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.600" end="00:01:05.800" style="s2">this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.000" end="00:01:05.800" style="s2">I&#39;d like you to have it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.900" end="00:01:10.500" style="s2">I hope it brings you good luck.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.100" end="00:01:10.500" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.800" end="00:01:16.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.800" end="00:01:16.500" style="s2">she&#39;s interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.500" end="00:01:24.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Simon, once we&#39;re married,</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.900" end="00:01:27.800" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep backing your business</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.200" end="00:01:27.800" style="s2">even if it takes everything I have.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.700" end="00:01:42.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.600" end="00:01:43.900" style="s2">Dad, I got into the startup incubator. I</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.400" end="00:01:46.500" style="s2">can finally launch my business in San</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.900" end="00:01:46.500" style="s2">Francisco.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.000" end="00:01:51.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re not giving you any government</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.200" end="00:01:53.800" style="s2">funding.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.600" end="00:01:56.200" style="s2">What&#39;s there to celebrate?</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.800" end="00:01:58.100" style="s2">I don&#39;t have money to bankroll you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.200" end="00:02:00.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are we supposed to fund a business</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.100" end="00:02:02.792" style="s2">on what we make doing odd jobs.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.892" end="00:02:04.892" style="s2">Find yourself a rich woman. Take some</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.792" end="00:02:07.392" style="s2">pressure off this family.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.892" end="00:02:10.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People like us starting businesses,</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.392" end="00:02:13.592" style="s2">that&#39;s money down the drain.</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.292" end="00:02:13.592" style="s2">You might as well buy me a drink.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.192" end="00:02:22.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t tear it up. You can&#39;t throw away</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.292" end="00:02:24.292" style="s2">an opportunity like this.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.392" end="00:02:25.892" style="s2">I&#39;ll help you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.292" end="00:02:27.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You grew up in a children&#39;s home. You</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.892" end="00:02:29.092" style="s2">just got into MIT and you don&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.292" end="00:02:30.792" style="s2">know how you&#39;ll pay tuition.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.092" end="00:02:32.792" style="s2">How could you help me?</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.792" end="00:02:34.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll work around my classes.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.792" end="00:02:36.792" style="s2">I&#39;ll earn enough to help you get your</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.092" end="00:02:36.792" style="s2">business started.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.392" end="00:02:58.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Layla, I asked you here because I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.192" end="00:03:00.092" style="s2">breaking up with you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.492" end="00:03:01.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re breaking up with me?</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.092" end="00:03:03.392" style="s2">Last month you said business was picking</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.992" end="00:03:06.792" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.392" end="00:03:06.792" style="s2">You said you were going to propose.</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.192" end="00:03:15.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My son&#39;s successful, young, and</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.392" end="00:03:17.692" style="s2">handsome.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.592" end="00:03:19.692" style="s2">Women are lining up for him. You&#39;re a</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.692" end="00:03:22.192" style="s2">waitress at some club.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.692" end="00:03:25.292" style="s2">You think you&#39;re good enough for him?</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.192" end="00:03:25.292" style="s2">Have some self-respect.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.192" end="00:03:32.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You expect my son to propose and this</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.692" end="00:03:34.292" style="s2">cheap thing is what you got him in</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.592" end="00:03:35.692" style="s2">return?</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.292" end="00:03:37.992" style="s2">Dream on.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.692" end="00:03:40.492" style="s2">Simon, say something.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.992" end="00:03:41.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Giving him a little startup money</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.492" end="00:03:43.892" style="s2">doesn&#39;t mean you get to cling to him</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.892" end="00:03:45.592" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.892" end="00:03:47.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You might as well know</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.592" end="00:03:50.192" style="s2">my son already proposed to the marketing</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.992" end="00:03:52.892" style="s2">manager at Gray Tech.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.192" end="00:03:54.492" style="s2">Look what she gave him in return.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.892" end="00:03:55.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take your cheap crap and get lost,</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.492" end="00:03:59.592" style="s2">Layla.</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.592" end="00:03:59.592" style="s2">From now on we don&#39;t know each other.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.792" end="00:04:03.994" style="s2">Too trusting for your own good.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.092" end="00:04:06.494" style="s2">That never ends well.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.994" end="00:04:10.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Consider this a thank you for the coin.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.494" end="00:04:10.094" style="s2">You&#39;re in for the surprise of your life.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.194" end="00:04:18.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A Patek Philippe.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.894" end="00:04:19.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve seen that watch in the store.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.194" end="00:04:23.594" style="s2">It&#39;s worth millions.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.894" end="00:04:26.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What rich family did he come from?</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.594" end="00:04:26.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you staring at?</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.594" end="00:04:31.894" style="s2">You think a man like that would look</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.794" end="00:04:31.894" style="s2">twice at an ugly little nobody like you?</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.294" end="00:04:42.494" style="s2">I&#39;m here to ask you to marry me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.994" end="00:04:48.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t make fun of me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.994" end="00:04:50.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, she&#39;s broke. She scrapes by doing</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.794" end="00:04:52.094" style="s2">odd jobs. She&#39;s nowhere near your</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.994" end="00:04:54.194" style="s2">league.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.094" end="00:04:55.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She could work for a 100 years</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.194" end="00:04:57.994" style="s2">and still not afford that watch of</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.694" end="00:04:57.994" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.494" end="00:05:04.894" style="s2">I decide who&#39;s good enough for me. You</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.394" end="00:05:06.394" style="s2">don&#39;t get a vote.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.894" end="00:05:08.294" style="s2">That&#39;s the ring of one of San</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.394" end="00:05:11.894" style="s2">Francisco&#39;s oldest families. That ring</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.294" end="00:05:11.894" style="s2">will get you in anywhere in this city.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.094" end="00:05:15.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m asking you to marry me with this</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.494" end="00:05:17.594" style="s2">ring.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.794" end="00:05:19.194" style="s2">Do you believe I&#39;m serious now?</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.594" end="00:05:21.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, marriage isn&#39;t something you joke</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.194" end="00:05:23.694" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.694" end="00:05:25.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drop the act, Lyla.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.694" end="00:05:27.194" style="s2">Men from families like his marry women</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.394" end="00:05:29.394" style="s2">from families like theirs.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.194" end="00:05:31.594" style="s2">Not some low-class waitress.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.394" end="00:05:33.594" style="s2">You even got a fake ring.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.594" end="00:05:35.494" style="s2">It&#39;s pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.594" end="00:05:36.694" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know you had it in you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.494" end="00:05:38.894" style="s2">Paying someone to put on this little</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.694" end="00:05:40.894" style="s2">show.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.894" end="00:05:44.694" style="s2">You&#39;ve hit a new low, Lyla.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.894" end="00:05:44.694" style="s2">Hiring a man to pretend he wants you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.594" end="00:05:53.694" style="s2">Play all the games you want, Lyla.</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.994" end="00:05:56.894" style="s2">I&#39;m not changing my mind.</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.694" end="00:05:56.894" style="s2">You have no place in my life.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.794" end="00:06:07.295" style="s2">If you can&#39;t watch your mouth,</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.695" end="00:06:08.695" style="s2">I&#39;ll teach you how.</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.295" end="00:06:11.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re just some male assistant Layla</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.695" end="00:06:12.695" style="s2">hired from a club.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.195" end="00:06:15.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who do you think you&#39;re fooling?</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.695" end="00:06:17.495" style="s2">If this is real, go get married right</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.095" end="00:06:17.495" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.795" end="00:06:21.195" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.395" end="00:06:31.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t this a little fast?</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.695" end="00:06:33.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t waste time.</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.039" end="00:06:33.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.095" end="00:06:40.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll sign.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.695" end="00:06:42.495" style="s2">It&#39;s not like I have anything left to</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.095" end="00:06:42.495" style="s2">lose.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.449" end="00:06:47.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.995" end="00:06:52.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They actually</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.695" end="00:06:54.095" style="s2">got married?</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.395" end="00:06:56.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would a handsome young man like him</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.095" end="00:06:58.295" style="s2">marry that little</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.095" end="00:07:00.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Layla is my wife now. Disrespect her</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.295" end="00:07:00.795" style="s2">again</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.695" end="00:07:06.095" style="s2">and you&#39;ll pay a price you can&#39;t afford.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.295" end="00:07:24.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This room is bigger than my entire</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.795" end="00:07:25.095" style="s2">apartment. Everything in here looks so</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.095" end="00:07:26.895" style="s2">expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.095" end="00:07:28.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I&#39;m not working,</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.895" end="00:07:31.295" style="s2">this is where I like to be.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.795" end="00:07:34.395" style="s2">Relax. Take a seat.</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.295" end="00:07:34.395" style="s2">Everything here is yours, too.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.595" end="00:07:38.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, who exactly are you?</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.595" end="00:07:44.795" style="s2">Galen Gray.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.195" end="00:07:44.795" style="s2">Why does that name sound so familiar?</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.895" end="00:07:50.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gray Tech CEO Galen Gray signed a</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.695" end="00:07:52.095" style="s2">strategic partnership agreement with the</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.295" end="00:07:53.595" style="s2">Silicon Valley Research Institute today.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.095" end="00:07:55.895" style="s2">Under his leadership, Gray Tech&#39;s market</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.595" end="00:07:58.495" style="s2">value has surpassed 10 billion.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.895" end="00:08:00.695" style="s2">The CEO of Gray Tech proposed to me</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.495" end="00:08:03.195" style="s2">and I actually married him?</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.695" end="00:08:04.395" style="s2">I married into that kind of money?</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.195" end="00:08:05.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.395" end="00:08:07.595" style="s2">am I good enough for you?</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.595" end="00:08:09.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t tease me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.595" end="00:08:12.597" style="s2">Someone as important as you stepping</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.497" end="00:08:14.497" style="s2">into help me. I&#39;m already so grateful.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.597" end="00:08:16.097" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t possibly ask for more.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.497" end="00:08:19.297" style="s2">I&#39;ll divorce you tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.097" end="00:08:19.297" style="s2">I promise I won&#39;t get in your way.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.497" end="00:08:23.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I stood up for you and this is how you</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.597" end="00:08:25.197" style="s2">repay me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.197" end="00:08:27.097" style="s2">Married today, divorced tomorrow. What</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.197" end="00:08:29.097" style="s2">kind of man do you take me for?</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.097" end="00:08:30.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, that&#39;s not what I meant.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.097" end="00:08:33.997" style="s2">I just thought someone in your position</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.997" end="00:08:36.897" style="s2">would marry a socialite, an heiress,</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.997" end="00:08:36.897" style="s2">not someone like me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.297" end="00:08:46.297" style="s2">Mr. Grey, I won&#39;t try to marry you</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.397" end="00:08:49.997" style="s2">again. Please let me go. Don&#39;t throw me</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.297" end="00:08:49.997" style="s2">in. I won&#39;t DO IT AGAIN.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.497" end="00:08:59.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NOW YOU HAVE NO COMPETITION.</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.297" end="00:09:01.597" style="s2">YOU KNOW WHAT TO DO, don&#39;t you Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.297" end="00:09:01.597" style="s2">Grey?</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.497" end="00:09:14.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is every dollar I&#39;ve earned</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.897" end="00:09:15.997" style="s2">and spent for the past few years.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.197" end="00:09:19.297" style="s2">I used to show it to Simon.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.997" end="00:09:20.997" style="s2">From now on, I&#39;ll show it to you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.297" end="00:09:23.297" style="s2">I&#39;m your wife now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.997" end="00:09:25.897" style="s2">I&#39;ll be completely faithful to you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.297" end="00:09:27.397" style="s2">I won&#39;t hide anything.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.897" end="00:09:29.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I need your money?</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.397" end="00:09:31.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re in this together.</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.697" end="00:09:33.797" style="s2">I need to pull my weight.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.997" end="00:09:35.997" style="s2">I don&#39;t make much now,</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.797" end="00:09:37.297" style="s2">but I&#39;ve been researching AI. Once I get</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.997" end="00:09:40.197" style="s2">a patent,</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.297" end="00:09:40.197" style="s2">I&#39;ll be able to help you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.097" end="00:09:48.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As my wife, you get a million dollars</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.197" end="00:09:50.997" style="s2">a month to spend. Your only job is to</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.297" end="00:09:50.997" style="s2">keep me happy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.497" end="00:09:54.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A million a month? You want to pay me to</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.697" end="00:09:56.497" style="s2">sit here</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.897" end="00:09:58.697" style="s2">and look pretty?</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.497" end="00:09:59.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A wife, a kept woman, what does it</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.697" end="00:10:01.951" style="s2">matter</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.897" end="00:10:03.971" style="s2">as long as you&#39;re living well?</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.951" end="00:10:03.971" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.597" end="00:10:06.997" style="s2">Game.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.497" end="00:10:09.697" style="s2">What&#39;s a woman doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.997" end="00:10:11.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I have to get to work. I should go.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.697" end="00:10:12.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never bring women</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.498" end="00:10:14.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since when did that change?</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.698" end="00:10:16.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s your sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.098" end="00:10:20.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.698" end="00:10:23.098" style="s2">Blue Star Golf Club, 1 p.m.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.298" end="00:10:23.098" style="s2">Terrace 8.</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.298" end="00:10:27.298" style="s2">Blue Star?</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.998" end="00:10:30.398" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that the golf course you started</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.298" end="00:10:31.898" style="s2">for fun back in college?</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.398" end="00:10:34.047" style="s2">What are the odds?</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.898" end="00:10:35.098" style="s2">Looks like we were bound to cross paths.</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.047" end="00:10:35.998" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.098" end="00:10:38.698" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.998" end="00:10:38.698" style="s2">Let&#39;s go take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.898" end="00:10:46.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.798" end="00:10:48.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you two doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.298" end="00:10:49.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re here to celebrate with you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.198" end="00:10:51.198" style="s2">Simon invited us to celebrate the</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.698" end="00:10:52.798" style="s2">engagement.</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.198" end="00:10:54.898" style="s2">I can&#39;t believe you&#39;re the first of us</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.798" end="00:10:56.098" style="s2">to get married.</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.898" end="00:10:57.698" style="s2">You wouldn&#39;t even buy yourself decent</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.098" end="00:10:59.498" style="s2">clothes because you were funding his</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.698" end="00:11:01.998" style="s2">business. It&#39;s about time Simon</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.498" end="00:11:01.998" style="s2">proposed.</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.212" end="00:11:04.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.177" end="00:11:05.798" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.798" end="00:11:06.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do you look like you sleep on the</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.798" end="00:11:09.198" style="s2">street?</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.898" end="00:11:10.898" style="s2">Can you wear something decent?</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.198" end="00:11:11.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t mind wearing old clothes. We can</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.898" end="00:11:13.998" style="s2">use the money to buy the models you</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.998" end="00:11:15.998" style="s2">need.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.998" end="00:11:17.698" style="s2">Someone did propose to me today,</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.998" end="00:11:19.198" style="s2">but it wasn&#39;t Simon.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.698" end="00:11:20.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After everything you&#39;ve done for him,</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.198" end="00:11:23.698" style="s2">how could he not propose?</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.698" end="00:11:23.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is that so hard to believe?</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.798" end="00:11:27.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fiona, we&#39;re best friends.</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.298" end="00:11:30.377" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s your problem?</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.698" end="00:11:30.398" style="s2">I proposed to Fiona. She&#39;s my fiancée.</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.377" end="00:11:32.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.398" end="00:11:33.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Simon, what are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.298" end="00:11:35.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was I not clear?</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.498" end="00:11:36.998" style="s2">I am done with that loser, Lyla.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.498" end="00:11:39.098" style="s2">Let me make it official.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.998" end="00:11:40.698" style="s2">My fiancée is Fiona, the marketing</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.098" end="00:11:42.698" style="s2">manager at one of San Francisco&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.698" end="00:11:45.598" style="s2">leading tech companies. She makes over</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.698" end="00:11:46.698" style="s2">$10,000 a month, not this broke little</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.598" end="00:11:48.398" style="s2">nobody.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.698" end="00:11:51.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were like a sister to me. How could</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.398" end="00:11:51.398" style="s2">you steal my boyfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.898" end="00:11:55.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lyla, I didn&#39;t make Simon dump you. You</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.298" end="00:11:57.233" style="s2">couldn&#39;t keep your boyfriend interested.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.898" end="00:11:57.298" style="s2">How is that my fault?</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.233" end="00:11:58.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.298" end="00:11:59.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fiona,</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.298" end="00:12:01.998" style="s2">why are you wasting your breath</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.898" end="00:12:03.598" style="s2">on some waitress at a golf club?</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.998" end="00:12:05.098" style="s2">She makes next to nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.598" end="00:12:07.098" style="s2">She&#39;s beneath you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.098" end="00:12:08.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you proposed to my best friend</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.098" end="00:12:10.599" style="s2">because I don&#39;t make enough money?</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.798" end="00:12:11.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I want someone who can help</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.599" end="00:12:13.498" style="s2">Let ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.798" end="00:12:14.899" style="s2">How&#39;s your lousy paycheck?</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.498" end="00:12:16.799" style="s2">It&#39;s to fund my startup?</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.899" end="00:12:17.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank god you never proposed to me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.799" end="00:12:19.999" style="s2">Marrying you would have been the biggest</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.899" end="00:12:21.899" style="s2">mistake of my life. [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.999" end="00:12:22.799" style="s2">I hope you two stay together forever.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.899" end="00:12:23.999" style="s2">Maybe</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.799" end="00:12:25.399" style="s2">that&#39;ll keep you from wrecking anyone</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.999" end="00:12:28.699" style="s2">else&#39;s relationship.</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.399" end="00:12:30.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Simon, what the hell are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.699" end="00:12:31.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Simon, just because I used to love you</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.899" end="00:12:32.899" style="s2">doesn&#39;t mean you get to treat me like</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.999" end="00:12:34.499" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.899" end="00:12:36.299" style="s2">Remember, we&#39;re paying customers. We can</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.499" end="00:12:38.099" style="s2">treat you however we want. As far as I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.299" end="00:12:40.599" style="s2">concerned, you&#39;re trash.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.099" end="00:12:43.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fiona, you stole Layla&#39;s husband and now</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.599" end="00:12:44.299" style="s2">you&#39;re saying this? Have you no shame?</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.299" end="00:12:45.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fiona,</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.299" end="00:12:48.799" style="s2">making a million a year doesn&#39;t make you</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.499" end="00:12:49.999" style="s2">special. Layla was a top student at MIT.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.799" end="00:12:52.099" style="s2">She&#39;s going to go a lot further than</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.999" end="00:12:52.099" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.599" end="00:12:56.099" style="s2">A loser who can&#39;t do anything but wait</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.099" end="00:12:57.499" style="s2">tables is claiming she was a top student</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.099" end="00:12:58.499" style="s2">at MIT?</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.499" end="00:13:01.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How embarrassing.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.499" end="00:13:01.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s all this shouting about?</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.099" end="00:13:05.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re harassing one of your employees.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.999" end="00:13:07.599" style="s2">You&#39;re the manager. You need to do</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.099" end="00:13:07.599" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.699" end="00:13:11.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who said you could insult our guests?</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.299" end="00:13:14.099" style="s2">Apologize to them now. Fiona, we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.499" end="00:13:15.499" style="s2">honored you chose to visit our club.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.099" end="00:13:17.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wouldn&#39;t normally come here, but one</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.499" end="00:13:19.099" style="s2">of your waiters has had the nerve to hit</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.399" end="00:13:20.699" style="s2">on my man.</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.099" end="00:13:22.299" style="s2">She needs to pay for that.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.699" end="00:13:23.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who would dare do something like that?</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.299" end="00:13:24.999" style="s2">Layla,</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.299" end="00:13:27.299" style="s2">the one who stocks your cigars.</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.999" end="00:13:29.199" style="s2">Fiona, I&#39;ll make sure that loser learns</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.299" end="00:13:30.399" style="s2">her lesson. Just put in a good word for</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.199" end="00:13:32.799" style="s2">me with Mr. Gray, will you?</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.399" end="00:13:33.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. Handle this properly and</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.799" end="00:13:37.599" style="s2">I&#39;ll make it worth your while.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.999" end="00:13:37.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you deaf? Apologize to her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.299" end="00:13:40.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re the ones in the wrong. Why</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.399" end="00:13:41.899" style="s2">should I apologize?</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.599" end="00:13:43.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you just say?</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.899" end="00:13:44.499" style="s2">The customer is always right at</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.299" end="00:13:46.099" style="s2">Marketing. Do you really think you can</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.499" end="00:13:48.699" style="s2">afford to cross her?</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.099" end="00:13:48.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Gray,</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.499" end="00:13:52.199" style="s2">excuse me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.699" end="00:13:55.099" style="s2">You dropped your bread. I found this</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.199" end="00:13:56.699" style="s2">lucky coin by the fountain this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.099" end="00:13:58.099" style="s2">I&#39;d like you to have it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.699" end="00:13:59.399" style="s2">I hope it brings you good luck.</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.099" end="00:14:01.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s really something.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.399" end="00:14:02.899" style="s2">Gaylen, what is it about Layla? What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.199" end="00:14:03.899" style="s2">got you so hooked?</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.899" end="00:14:04.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll see what I mean when you meet</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.899" end="00:14:06.199" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.999" end="00:14:07.399" style="s2">Layla&#39;s friends will be there too. Is</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.199" end="00:14:09.599" style="s2">everything arranged?</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.399" end="00:14:11.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. I &#39;ve got it covered. We&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.599" end="00:14:12.799" style="s2">sure Layla gets the VIP treatment.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.699" end="00:14:14.299" style="s2">Layla,</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.799" end="00:14:16.001" style="s2">why are you just standing there? Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.299" end="00:14:17.801" style="s2">Gray runs the largest tech company in</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.001" end="00:14:19.901" style="s2">San Francisco. He&#39;s one of the richest</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.801" end="00:14:20.701" style="s2">men in Silicon Valley. Everyone respects</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.901" end="00:14:22.101" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.701" end="00:14:23.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know how powerful Mr. Gray is,</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.101" end="00:14:25.401" style="s2">but I know a man like him would care</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.701" end="00:14:27.001" style="s2">who&#39;s right and who&#39;s wrong. He wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.401" end="00:14:28.501" style="s2">let you bully people like this.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.001" end="00:14:29.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you going to tell us, Mr. Gray</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.501" end="00:14:32.301" style="s2">was the one who proposed to you today?</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.901" end="00:14:34.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; be part of his world. Stop bullying her.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.301" end="00:14:36.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I wrong? She needs a reality check.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.601" end="00:14:38.901" style="s2">All she wants is a rich man to latch</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.501" end="00:14:40.901" style="s2">onto. I invited you here so you&#39;d see</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.901" end="00:14:44.501" style="s2">what Lila really is. Even I don&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.901" end="00:14:46.201" style="s2">her. Why would Mr. Gray marry her?</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.501" end="00:14:48.001" style="s2">Lila, a gentleman who says he&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.201" end="00:14:48.901" style="s2">husband ordered this box of lady cigars</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.001" end="00:14:51.501" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.901" end="00:14:51.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My husband?</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.701" end="00:14:54.901" style="s2">Those are Davidoffs.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.401" end="00:14:56.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t those really expensive?</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.901" end="00:14:58.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could someone as broke as Lila</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.601" end="00:15:01.101" style="s2">afford cigars like that? They have to be</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.801" end="00:15:01.101" style="s2">fake.</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.201" end="00:15:04.565" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re real Davidoffs.</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.301" end="00:15:06.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow. Lila&#39;s got some serious money if</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.565" end="00:15:08.101" style="s2">[snorts] she&#39;s buying cigars like these.</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.301" end="00:15:09.301" style="s2">You heard the server. Lila&#39;s husband</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.101" end="00:15:10.501" style="s2">ordered them for her.</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.301" end="00:15:12.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lila&#39;s husband?</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.501" end="00:15:13.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, did Mr. Gray really propose to</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.301" end="00:15:14.901" style="s2">Lila today?</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.501" end="00:15:15.901" style="s2">No wonder she said she was glad Simon</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.901" end="00:15:18.201" style="s2">didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.901" end="00:15:19.601" style="s2">If I got to marry a young rich catch</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.201" end="00:15:22.701" style="s2">like Mr. Gray,</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.601" end="00:15:24.201" style="s2">I&#39;d be thanking God too. Absolutely not.</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.701" end="00:15:26.301" style="s2">A man like Mr. Gray would wouldn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.201" end="00:15:27.801" style="s2">look at Lila. Why would he propose to</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.301" end="00:15:29.801" style="s2">her? She&#39;s shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.801" end="00:15:31.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fiona&#39;s right. If Mr. Gray really</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.801" end="00:15:32.401" style="s2">proposed to Lila, why would she pay a</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.301" end="00:15:34.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.401" end="00:15:36.601" style="s2">Lila must have stolen those cigars. Lila</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.601" end="00:15:38.201" style="s2">would never do that. Don&#39;t accuse me of</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.601" end="00:15:39.901" style="s2">stealing. Not everyone is [snorts] as</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.201" end="00:15:42.601" style="s2">rotten as you are.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.901" end="00:15:43.901" style="s2">You stocked the cigars taking a</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.601" end="00:15:44.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lila, you had the nerve to steal our</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.901" end="00:15:46.501" style="s2">cigars?</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.701" end="00:15:48.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.501" end="00:15:50.101" style="s2">The cigars are right there. You&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.201" end="00:15:51.201" style="s2">going to deny it?</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.101" end="00:15:51.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m calling the police. You&#39;re getting</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.201" end="00:15:53.101" style="s2">arrested.</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.901" end="00:15:55.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t steal</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.101" end="00:15:57.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no need to call the police. Lila</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.401" end="00:15:59.201" style="s2">and I used to be friends after all. I</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.301" end="00:16:01.701" style="s2">couldn&#39;t bear to see her locked up.</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.201" end="00:16:02.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fiona, you have such a good heart.</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.701" end="00:16:04.701" style="s2">I love you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.901" end="00:16:08.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Spare us the saint act.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.701" end="00:16:08.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring me a box of the cheap cigars.</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.801" end="00:16:12.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lila,</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.901" end="00:16:14.201" style="s2">smoke every one of these and I &#39;ll tell</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.701" end="00:16:16.201" style="s2">Shay to let you off.</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.201" end="00:16:19.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t push your luck, Lila. Today&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.201" end="00:16:21.902" style="s2">day I propose to Fiona. Otherwise, we be</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.102" end="00:16:25.702" style="s2">letting you off so easily.</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.902" end="00:16:25.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you hear me? Smoke.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.902" end="00:16:30.402" style="s2">That&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.102" end="00:16:33.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lyla, how dare you talk to Fiona like</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.402" end="00:16:34.602" style="s2">that? I can throw you out right now.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.002" end="00:16:37.302" style="s2">You&#39;ll never work here again.</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.602" end="00:16:38.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, so now you&#39;re getting physical?</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.302" end="00:16:41.302" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you just say Mr. Grey proposed to</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.902" end="00:16:43.002" style="s2">you? Go on then.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.302" end="00:16:44.702" style="s2">Go live the good life as his rich little</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.002" end="00:16:46.502" style="s2">wife.</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.702" end="00:16:47.902" style="s2">I&#39;m lucky a man like Callum chose me to</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.502" end="00:16:51.202" style="s2">be his wife.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.902" end="00:16:51.202" style="s2">I can&#39;t be a burden to him.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.302" end="00:16:56.102" style="s2">Lyla, stop smoking.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.502" end="00:16:58.002" style="s2">Trash is trash. All you&#39;re good for is</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.102" end="00:16:58.502" style="s2">being looked down on and walked all</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.002" end="00:17:01.402" style="s2">over.</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.502" end="00:17:03.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lyla, don&#39;t listen to that</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.402" end="00:17:05.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you stop. Keep smoking. Losers</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.702" end="00:17:07.602" style="s2">like her were born to be walked all</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.202" end="00:17:08.702" style="s2">over. Cheap cigars are all they deserve.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.602" end="00:17:11.102" style="s2">People of our standing get the good</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.702" end="00:17:11.102" style="s2">stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.402" end="00:17:15.902" style="s2">Some MIT genius, you&#39;re lower than</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.802" end="00:17:17.802" style="s2">trash. I make more money. I have more</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.902" end="00:17:19.202" style="s2">status. That means I get to treat you</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.802" end="00:17:20.602" style="s2">however I want.</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.202" end="00:17:22.402" style="s2">You&#39;re just my plaything.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.602" end="00:17:24.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Grey proposed to you?</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.402" end="00:17:24.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what if Mr. Grey really did propose</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.102" end="00:17:26.302" style="s2">to me?</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.602" end="00:17:27.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not just a loser.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.302" end="00:17:29.402" style="s2">You&#39;re delusional.</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.702" end="00:17:32.302" style="s2">If you&#39;re so special,</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.402" end="00:17:34.302" style="s2">why don&#39;t you get Mr. Grey down here?</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.302" end="00:17:35.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Mr. Grey? He really is the heir</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.302" end="00:17:38.502" style="s2">to San Francisco&#39;s most prestigious</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.502" end="00:17:38.502" style="s2">family. He&#39;s gorgeous.</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.102" end="00:17:46.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here to ask you to marry me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.102" end="00:17:46.102" style="s2">How can it be him?</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.402" end="00:17:52.302" style="s2">Do I need to clear my schedule with you?</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.302" end="00:17:53.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you needed anything, you could have</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.302" end="00:17:55.602" style="s2">just called me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.302" end="00:17:57.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fiona&#39;s right. You put me in charge of</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.602" end="00:18:00.102" style="s2">this club. I&#39;ll make sure everything</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.202" end="00:18:00.102" style="s2">runs perfectly.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.802" end="00:18:04.702" style="s2">I&#39;m dealing with a thief right now.</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.102" end="00:18:07.102" style="s2">She had the nerve to steal our premium</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.702" end="00:18:08.902" style="s2">cigars. Saying she stole cigars and you</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.102" end="00:18:10.402" style="s2">caught her? Thanks to Fiona. We never</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.902" end="00:18:13.102" style="s2">would have caught her without her help.</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.402" end="00:18:15.802" style="s2">Mr. Grey, this is the who stole</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.102" end="00:18:15.802" style="s2">the cigars.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.202" end="00:18:20.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that really Mr. Grey?</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.002" end="00:18:22.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Keep your mouth shut. If I</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.402" end="00:18:24.603" style="s2">impress him and earn his trust, there&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.603" end="00:18:26.703" style="s2">no telling how far I could go.</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.603" end="00:18:28.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you believe her nerve?</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.703" end="00:18:30.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be upset. I&#39;ll have her thrown out</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.703" end="00:18:32.503" style="s2">right away.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.703" end="00:18:34.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.503" end="00:18:35.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up and get out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.803" end="00:18:36.703" style="s2">Who gave you permission to touch my</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.903" end="00:18:38.403" style="s2">wife?</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.703" end="00:18:41.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your wife? Layla was telling the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.403" end="00:18:41.703" style="s2">Mr. Grey really did propose to her.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.403" end="00:18:45.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does that feel [music] better?</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.303" end="00:18:46.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.503" end="00:18:48.203" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.803" end="00:18:50.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw the entry in your notebook.</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.203" end="00:18:50.903" style="s2">Thought I&#39;d come see you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.703" end="00:18:56.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry I embarrassed you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.103" end="00:18:58.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t embarrass me. [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.903" end="00:19:00.303" style="s2">Someone here just has a death wish.</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.703" end="00:19:02.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Grey,</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.303" end="00:19:05.103" style="s2">who the hell do you think you are</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.203" end="00:19:06.603" style="s2">treating my sister-in-law like that?</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.103" end="00:19:07.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Layla was just a server. I didn&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.603" end="00:19:09.503" style="s2">she was your wife.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.703" end="00:19:12.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what if she&#39;s a server?</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.503" end="00:19:12.803" style="s2">That gives you the right to abuse her?</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.003" end="00:19:14.903" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.803" end="00:19:17.103" style="s2">I&#39;ll put the golf club in Layla&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.903" end="00:19:19.403" style="s2">As of today, she&#39;s the new owner.</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.103" end="00:19:21.603" style="s2">This place is yours now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.403" end="00:19:22.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure about this?</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.603" end="00:19:24.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you say you wanted to help build</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.703" end="00:19:27.303" style="s2">a life together?</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.203" end="00:19:27.303" style="s2">Now you&#39;ve got a place to start.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.303" end="00:19:32.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who hired some guy to fake a proposal?</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.403" end="00:19:35.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know how this happened. Are you</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.903" end="00:19:36.803" style="s2">sure that&#39;s Mr. Grey?</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.103" end="00:19:39.103" style="s2">Maybe you&#39;ve got the wrong guy.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.803" end="00:19:41.703" style="s2">Why would a rich, powerful man like him</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.103" end="00:19:44.003" style="s2">want someone as ordinary as Layla?</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.703" end="00:19:47.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I wouldn&#39;t recognize Mr. Grey?</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.003" end="00:19:49.303" style="s2">You&#39;re the reason I GOT ON HIS BAD SIDE.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.103" end="00:19:51.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t put this all on me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.303" end="00:19:53.803" style="s2">You were the one who climbed into my bed</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.003" end="00:19:55.503" style="s2">and called Layla a worthless loser.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.803" end="00:19:59.003" style="s2">You said Mr. Grey thought so highly of</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.503" end="00:20:01.103" style="s2">you. He wanted to make you a VP.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.003" end="00:20:02.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Grey, please let me off this once. I</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.103" end="00:20:03.503" style="s2">know I was wrong. It&#39;ll never happen</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.603" end="00:20:05.503" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.503" end="00:20:07.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mistreated my wife. Now you&#39;ll pay</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.503" end="00:20:08.903" style="s2">for it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.003" end="00:20:12.003" style="s2">You heard my brother. Crawl out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.903" end="00:20:12.003" style="s2">As for you two</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.903" end="00:20:19.603" style="s2">Layla, you love me. You can&#39;t bear to</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.803" end="00:20:21.603" style="s2">see me get hurt. Fiona seduced me. That</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.603" end="00:20:23.905" style="s2">&#39;s why I made such a terrible mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.603" end="00:20:25.905" style="s2">You&#39;re the one I&#39;ve always loved.</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.905" end="00:20:27.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Layla, we&#39;re best friends. You&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.905" end="00:20:30.805" style="s2">forgive me. You won&#39;t let anything</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.905" end="00:20:32.605" style="s2">happen to me, right?</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.805" end="00:20:33.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve heard enough. Drag them out of</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.605" end="00:20:34.105" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.105" end="00:20:36.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.105" end="00:20:37.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Layla, I knew you still had feelings for</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.305" end="00:20:39.205" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.305" end="00:20:42.705" style="s2">Think about what you&#39;re doing, Layla.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.205" end="00:20:42.705" style="s2">My brother&#39;s doing all this for you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.205" end="00:20:46.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever I felt for you died the second</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.905" end="00:20:48.905" style="s2">you betrayed me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.805" end="00:20:51.305" style="s2">You mean less than nothing to me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.905" end="00:20:53.205" style="s2">You say we&#39;re best friends? Good.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.305" end="00:20:55.505" style="s2">Then as my best friend,</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.205" end="00:20:57.605" style="s2">you can finish the cigars I couldn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.505" end="00:20:59.905" style="s2">In fact, why don&#39;t you smoke twice as</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.605" end="00:21:01.405" style="s2">many?</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.905" end="00:21:02.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone bring over two more boxes of the</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.405" end="00:21:03.105" style="s2">cheap [music] cigars.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.854" end="00:21:06.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.105" end="00:21:08.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on, bestie. Show us how it&#39;s done.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.405" end="00:21:10.005" style="s2">Sounds like quite a party. I could hear</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.005" end="00:21:12.905" style="s2">you from outside.</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.005" end="00:21:12.905" style="s2">Mind if I join you?</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.905" end="00:21:22.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s she?</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.605" end="00:21:25.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Sullivan. She&#39;s partnering with</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.305" end="00:21:25.705" style="s2">Gray Tech on our next project.</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.005" end="00:21:29.905" style="s2">Miss Sullivan,</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.305" end="00:21:31.305" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know you played here.</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.905" end="00:21:33.205" style="s2">I should have come over to say hello.</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.305" end="00:21:35.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just here for a casual round. I</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.205" end="00:21:38.005" style="s2">recognized your voice outside, Mr. Gray,</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.605" end="00:21:39.205" style="s2">so I thought I&#39;d stop in for a chat.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.005" end="00:21:40.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marketing has just about everything</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.205" end="00:21:42.705" style="s2">worked out. We can sign tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.905" end="00:21:44.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.705" end="00:21:47.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Sullivan, you need to know that Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.605" end="00:21:49.605" style="s2">Gray lets his feelings run his business.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.405" end="00:21:52.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fiona, how can you even say that? You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.605" end="00:21:55.105" style="s2">the one who is bullying</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.605" end="00:21:56.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Can anyone prove it?</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.105" end="00:21:58.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would he insist on marrying someone</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.705" end="00:21:59.705" style="s2">so useless?</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.105" end="00:22:01.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with being a server? Does</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.705" end="00:22:02.905" style="s2">that make someone worthless? What else</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.605" end="00:22:04.105" style="s2">would you call yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.905" end="00:22:05.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve heard enough. [music] I have a</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.105" end="00:22:07.805" style="s2">pretty good idea of what happened here.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.805" end="00:22:09.205" style="s2">As for the project with Gray Tech,</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.805" end="00:22:12.005" style="s2">nothing changes.</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.205" end="00:22:12.005" style="s2">We sign tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.205" end="00:22:17.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What was that look just now?</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.305" end="00:22:20.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew Miss Sullivan would sign. That &#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.305" end="00:22:20.405" style="s2">why I was so sure of myself.</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.905" end="00:22:24.805" style="s2">Are you telling me how to do my job? You</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.905" end="00:22:25.406" style="s2">agreed to work with Gray Tech as a favor</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.805" end="00:22:26.406" style="s2">to me. Are you</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.406" end="00:22:29.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; kidding me?</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.406" end="00:22:31.506" style="s2">If I&#39;m doing anyone a favor, it&#39;s Lila.</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.706" end="00:22:33.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it. I need that file tomorrow and</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.506" end="00:22:34.506" style="s2">now everything&#39;s locked.</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.006" end="00:22:35.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a variant of Zeppelin ransomware.</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.506" end="00:22:36.806" style="s2">Don&#39;t pay them.</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.806" end="00:22:38.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know that?</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.806" end="00:22:39.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.106" end="00:22:41.406" style="s2">You&#39;re You&#39;re a waitress?</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.606" end="00:22:42.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Part time. I majored in computer science</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.406" end="00:22:44.406" style="s2">and artificial intelligence. There you</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.906" end="00:22:46.206" style="s2">go. Make sure you install the latest</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.406" end="00:22:48.006" style="s2">system patches. This ransomware exploits</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.206" end="00:22:49.106" style="s2">a vulnerability from last month.</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.006" end="00:22:50.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lila?</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.106" end="00:22:51.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.106" end="00:22:52.306" style="s2">You have no idea how important that file</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.506" end="00:22:53.906" style="s2">is to me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.306" end="00:22:55.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re welcome. Drink your coffee before</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.906" end="00:22:56.706" style="s2">it gets cold. I&#39;d better get back to</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.606" end="00:22:58.006" style="s2">work.</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.706" end="00:22:59.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Lila hadn&#39;t helped me, I would have</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.006" end="00:23:00.906" style="s2">lost a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.206" end="00:23:02.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I choose my partners based on character</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.906" end="00:23:04.306" style="s2">and competence. His choice of a wife</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.706" end="00:23:06.106" style="s2">only proves I was right. It gives me</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.306" end="00:23:07.506" style="s2">even more confidence in him.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.106" end="00:23:08.506" style="s2">Lila, let me know when you&#39;re free.</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.506" end="00:23:09.306" style="s2">We&#39;ll have a spa day.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.506" end="00:23:10.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My treat.</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.306" end="00:23:12.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Ms. Sullivan. Let&#39;s keep in</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.606" end="00:23:14.806" style="s2">touch.</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.706" end="00:23:16.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even Diana is singing your praises. She</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.806" end="00:23:18.506" style="s2">says I have good taste. You really are</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.706" end="00:23:20.106" style="s2">full of surprises.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.506" end="00:23:21.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.106" end="00:23:22.606" style="s2">I want to do my part to build a life</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.506" end="00:23:24.406" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.606" end="00:23:26.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Going somewhere? My wife offered you</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.406" end="00:23:29.306" style="s2">cigars. You&#39;re going to smoke them,</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.306" end="00:23:31.706" style="s2">every last one before you leave.</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.306" end="00:23:34.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How am I supposed to smoke all of those?</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.706" end="00:23:34.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ll help you finish.</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.506" end="00:23:38.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I CAN&#39;T SMOKE ANYMORE. I&#39;M CHOKING TO</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.206" end="00:23:39.206" style="s2">DEATH. PLEASE LET ME GO.</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.206" end="00:23:41.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LILA,</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.206" end="00:23:43.206" style="s2">after all those years together,</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.606" end="00:23:45.706" style="s2">you wouldn&#39;t do that to me, would you?</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.206" end="00:23:45.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.006" end="00:23:49.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know what happens when you upset me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.806" end="00:23:53.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me finish.</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.106" end="00:23:55.406" style="s2">You&#39;ll see you have nothing to be upset</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.306" end="00:23:57.106" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.406" end="00:23:59.006" style="s2">There&#39;s nothing left between us. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.106" end="00:24:00.606" style="s2">try to play on my feelings.</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.006" end="00:24:03.706" style="s2">My husband gave me this box of premium</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.606" end="00:24:05.906" style="s2">cigars. You smoked them.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.706" end="00:24:07.606" style="s2">You owe me a whole new box.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.906" end="00:24:08.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re so expensive. How am I supposed</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.606" end="00:24:11.506" style="s2">to afford that?</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.806" end="00:24:13.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could mow lawns, deliver newspapers,</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.506" end="00:24:14.206" style="s2">just like I did to support you while you</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.006" end="00:24:15.106" style="s2">started your business.</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.206" end="00:24:16.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It doesn&#39;t mean I accept you as my</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.106" end="00:24:18.306" style="s2">sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.706" end="00:24:19.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know I don&#39;t come from money. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.306" end="00:24:21.106" style="s2">the kind of woman people expect your</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.506" end="00:24:22.306" style="s2">brother to marry, but I&#39;ll work hard to</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.106" end="00:24:23.306" style="s2">keep up with him.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.306" end="00:24:25.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you two talking about back</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.306" end="00:24:27.606" style="s2">there? Keep up.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.606" end="00:24:29.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; X, you&#39;re a legend. That patch you</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.606" end="00:24:31.307" style="s2">posted on the forum was huge help. When</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.807" end="00:24:32.707" style="s2">can you walk us through the framework?</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.307" end="00:24:34.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gail, are you really going to marry her?</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.707" end="00:24:36.007" style="s2">She&#39;s nowhere near good enough for you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.507" end="00:24:37.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.007" end="00:24:38.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did I say that wasn&#39;t true? In all</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.408" end="00:24:40.707" style="s2">of San Francisco, the only person good</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.908" end="00:24:43.207" style="s2">enough to be your wife is X, the tech</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.707" end="00:24:43.207" style="s2">genius.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.707" end="00:24:46.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean X, the top genius on the Nova</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.807" end="00:24:48.408" style="s2">forum?</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.507" end="00:24:50.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s nothing X can&#39;t do. Any problem</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.408" end="00:24:52.107" style="s2">that comes up on that forum, she solves</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.007" end="00:24:53.908" style="s2">it like it&#39;s nothing. And the best part,</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.107" end="00:24:55.707" style="s2">every solution she posts is free,</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.908" end="00:24:57.307" style="s2">especially her AI work. She wants to</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.707" end="00:24:58.307" style="s2">bring costs down so everyone can afford</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.307" end="00:24:59.307" style="s2">real AI.</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.307" end="00:25:00.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t know people could be that</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.307" end="00:25:02.607" style="s2">selfless.</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.908" end="00:25:03.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If only you&#39;d married X, we&#39;d finally</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.607" end="00:25:05.507" style="s2">have someone who could hold the company</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.707" end="00:25:06.607" style="s2">together. Too bad all we know is that X</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.507" end="00:25:07.507" style="s2">is a woman.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.607" end="00:25:09.307" style="s2">That&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.507" end="00:25:10.707" style="s2">I&#39;d give anything to meet her and find</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.307" end="00:25:13.607" style="s2">out who she really is.</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.707" end="00:25:15.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; X is just a regular person.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.607" end="00:25:16.908" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to get so carried away.</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.107" end="00:25:20.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, please. You&#39;re talking like you know</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.908" end="00:25:20.807" style="s2">her. Why don&#39;t you just say you&#39;re X?</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.507" end="00:25:25.307" style="s2">Are you actually going to run with that?</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.408" end="00:25:27.707" style="s2">Try to convince me you&#39;re X.</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.307" end="00:25:27.707" style="s2">Dream on.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.107" end="00:25:32.807" style="s2">You&#39;ve had a long day. Aren&#39;t you tired?</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.107" end="00:25:34.807" style="s2">Come lie down.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.807" end="00:25:36.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re sleeping in the same bed?</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.807" end="00:25:36.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.107" end="00:25:37.707" style="s2">Are you planning to sleep somewhere</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.908" end="00:25:39.908" style="s2">else?</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.707" end="00:25:41.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not tired. Maybe we could talk.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.908" end="00:25:43.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want to talk about?</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.607" end="00:25:44.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you ask me to marry you?</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.707" end="00:25:46.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know Great Tech?</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.707" end="00:25:47.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone in Silicon Valley does. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.007" end="00:25:49.408" style="s2">the biggest tech company around.</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.607" end="00:25:51.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It looks powerful from the outside, but</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.408" end="00:25:52.807" style="s2">it has been gutted. It&#39;s a mess inside.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.007" end="00:25:54.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you fix it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.807" end="00:25:54.908" style="s2">At least you have a family to back you</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.007" end="00:25:56.107" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.908" end="00:25:58.107" style="s2">I don&#39;t even have that.</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.107" end="00:25:59.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nate and I aren&#39;t actually Grays.</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.107" end="00:26:01.107" style="s2">When we were little, our parents had an</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.307" end="00:26:02.207" style="s2">accident. They entrusted us to the Gray</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.107" end="00:26:03.807" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.207" end="00:26:05.807" style="s2">What my parents didn&#39;t know was that the</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.807" end="00:26:06.807" style="s2">Grays only took us in</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.807" end="00:26:08.007" style="s2">to get their hands on the family</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.807" end="00:26:09.908" style="s2">business.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.007" end="00:26:11.507" style="s2">I fought to get it back, but I still</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.908" end="00:26:12.707" style="s2">can&#39;t get free of them.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.507" end="00:26:13.507" style="s2">And get free of them.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.707" end="00:26:14.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re trying to force you into an</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.507" end="00:26:15.607" style="s2">arranged marriage?</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.607" end="00:26:17.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They want to use the marriage to dilute</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.607" end="00:26:17.908" style="s2">my stake in the company and push me out</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.107" end="00:26:19.408" style="s2">of power.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.908" end="00:26:21.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you just picked me at random off the</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.408" end="00:26:21.707" style="s2">street?</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.408" end="00:26:26.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t pick you at random.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.007" end="00:26:27.707" style="s2">I knew you wouldn&#39;t stab me in the back.</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.207" end="00:26:29.307" style="s2">Then you&#39;ll have to show me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.707" end="00:26:30.607" style="s2">The company needs an heir.</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.307" end="00:26:31.509" style="s2">That&#39;ll finally get those old vultures</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.607" end="00:26:33.609" style="s2">to off.</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.509" end="00:26:35.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not asking me to</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.609" end="00:26:37.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen, someone&#39;s attacking the company</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.309" end="00:26:40.109" style="s2">servers. We need to come take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.509" end="00:26:42.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company needs you. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.109" end="00:26:42.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t wait up.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.109" end="00:26:49.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; X, could we meet to talk about your AI</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.609" end="00:26:51.009" style="s2">idea? X, your ideas are brilliant.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.009" end="00:26:52.209" style="s2">They&#39;re exactly what our company needs.</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.009" end="00:26:53.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have time to talk?</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.209" end="00:26:57.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meet me in an hour at the computer lab</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.709" end="00:26:59.509" style="s2">at Space 29. Wait for me there.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.609" end="00:27:00.609" style="s2">Get me to the computer lab at Space 29</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.509" end="00:27:01.709" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.609" end="00:27:04.609" style="s2">We&#39;re going to the computer lab at Space</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.709" end="00:27:04.609" style="s2">29 right now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.509" end="00:27:09.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you sleep well? Come to my vineyard</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.009" end="00:27:09.409" style="s2">with me later.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.709" end="00:27:11.509" style="s2">I want to introduce you to the board as</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.709" end="00:27:12.809" style="s2">my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.509" end="00:27:13.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that a little soon?</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.809" end="00:27:14.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hit the jackpot and you&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.809" end="00:27:15.509" style="s2">complaining?</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.509" end="00:27:16.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I meet you there afterwards?</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.509" end="00:27:18.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. You can quit your other jobs</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.809" end="00:27:19.909" style="s2">while you&#39;re out. I&#39;ll be waiting at the</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.309" end="00:27:22.009" style="s2">vineyard. Blair and Sandra are two of</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.909" end="00:27:23.009" style="s2">the biggest names in Silicon Valley. Why</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.009" end="00:27:23.609" style="s2">would they meet in a little place like</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.009" end="00:27:24.809" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.609" end="00:27:26.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard they&#39;re waiting for someone. I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.809" end="00:27:27.509" style="s2">love to know who. Must be somebody</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.209" end="00:27:28.309" style="s2">important.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.509" end="00:27:29.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want? We&#39;re closed to the</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.309" end="00:27:30.109" style="s2">public today. Get out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.109" end="00:27:31.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two industry giants are in there waiting</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.109" end="00:27:32.909" style="s2">for a VIP. Don&#39;t block the door. I&#39;m the</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.709" end="00:27:35.109" style="s2">person they&#39;re waiting for. Can I go in</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.909" end="00:27:35.109" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.009" end="00:27:40.009" style="s2">Look at her. Does she look anything like</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.809" end="00:27:41.709" style="s2">X to you?</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.009" end="00:27:42.909" style="s2">She&#39;s so young. And look at what she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.709" end="00:27:45.209" style="s2">wearing.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.909" end="00:27:46.809" style="s2">I can&#39;t believe that&#39;s X.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.209" end="00:27:48.709" style="s2">Who let her in?</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.809" end="00:27:51.009" style="s2">There must be some mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.709" end="00:27:53.009" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you two want to talk to me?</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.009" end="00:27:55.909" style="s2">Why so quiet?</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.009" end="00:27:57.209" style="s2">Are you really X?</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.909" end="00:27:59.609" style="s2">You&#39;re not lying to us?</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.209" end="00:28:02.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course she&#39;s lying. X is a genius.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.609" end="00:28:02.509" style="s2">There&#39;s no way it&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.209" end="00:28:07.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can you prove you&#39;re X?</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.009" end="00:28:08.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two years ago, your company&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.009" end="00:28:09.609" style="s2">computational model had a major</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.309" end="00:28:11.109" style="s2">vulnerability.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.609" end="00:28:13.909" style="s2">I wrote the patch that fixed it. These</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.109" end="00:28:13.909" style="s2">are the opening lines.</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.609" end="00:28:19.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are the opening lines.</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.809" end="00:28:20.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, that&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.209" end="00:28:22.309" style="s2">A year ago, you had a problem with your</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.909" end="00:28:23.809" style="s2">chip framework.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.309" end="00:28:25.809" style="s2">I gave you the open source framework</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.809" end="00:28:27.209" style="s2">that got you through it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.809" end="00:28:31.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are its core commands.</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.209" end="00:28:33.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly right. You really are X.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.409" end="00:28:34.110" style="s2">Do you need any more proof?</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.509" end="00:28:35.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, we</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.110" end="00:28:37.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; we believe you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.410" end="00:28:39.310" style="s2">It&#39;s an honor to meet you, X.</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.310" end="00:28:40.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d rather keep a low profile.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.310" end="00:28:41.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just call me Lila.</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.410" end="00:28:43.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.510" end="00:28:44.610" style="s2">X doesn&#39;t want the attention.</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.310" end="00:28:47.310" style="s2">We&#39;ll follow your lead.</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.610" end="00:28:49.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; X Sorry, Lila. About that AI concept you</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.310" end="00:28:50.210" style="s2">posted. That&#39;s why I asked you both</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.010" end="00:28:52.310" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.210" end="00:28:54.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The concept is already well developed.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.310" end="00:28:56.810" style="s2">Once I finish refining it, I&#39;ll license</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.310" end="00:28:57.510" style="s2">the completed AI system to Gray Tech for</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.810" end="00:28:59.210" style="s2">free.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.510" end="00:29:00.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; License it for free</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.210" end="00:29:03.110" style="s2">to Gray Tech?</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.310" end="00:29:05.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lila is funding the problem. I&#39;ll invest</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.110" end="00:29:08.110" style="s2">I&#39;ll put in 200 million.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.010" end="00:29:09.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t about funding.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.110" end="00:29:10.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.010" end="00:29:13.210" style="s2">I&#39;ll put the golf club in Lila&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.710" end="00:29:15.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to do something for him, too.</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.210" end="00:29:15.910" style="s2">I owe Galen.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.010" end="00:29:21.110" style="s2">She must owe Galen money.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.910" end="00:29:22.310" style="s2">I&#39;ll invest in Gray Tech and pay off her</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.110" end="00:29:24.010" style="s2">debt.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.310" end="00:29:26.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So will I.</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.010" end="00:29:28.910" style="s2">It&#39;s the least I can do after everything</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.110" end="00:29:28.910" style="s2">she&#39;s done for me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.310" end="00:29:38.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks for waiting for me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.110" end="00:29:41.110" style="s2">Sorry to put you out.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.910" end="00:29:42.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You rode here on that?</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.110" end="00:29:44.710" style="s2">And you&#39;re still wearing your work</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.210" end="00:29:44.710" style="s2">uniform?</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.810" end="00:29:48.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I paid $20 for this bike and the</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.810" end="00:29:49.210" style="s2">uniform.</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.010" end="00:29:50.110" style="s2">Of course I brought them with me when I</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.210" end="00:29:51.310" style="s2">quit.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.110" end="00:29:55.110" style="s2">Why waste them?</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.310" end="00:29:55.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unbelievable. Just get inside.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.710" end="00:30:02.510" style="s2">Mr. Nate, we&#39;ve got a major problem.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.910" end="00:30:05.110" style="s2">There&#39;s a bug in the new system. It</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.510" end="00:30:05.110" style="s2">won&#39;t run.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.710" end="00:30:11.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could a bug show up now?</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.910" end="00:30:13.510" style="s2">We need the system&#39;s test data today.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.810" end="00:30:15.210" style="s2">Running all the tests again</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.510" end="00:30:17.410" style="s2">would take at least two months.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.210" end="00:30:19.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It won&#39;t take that long.</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.410" end="00:30:21.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a server at a club.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.110" end="00:30:22.910" style="s2">What would you know?</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.010" end="00:30:24.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know a little about IT.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.910" end="00:30:27.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a good one.</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.710" end="00:30:28.310" style="s2">If you knew anything about IT,</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.310" end="00:30:30.710" style="s2">why would you be waiting tables at a</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.310" end="00:30:30.710" style="s2">club?</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.710" end="00:30:35.410" style="s2">Mr. Nate, the buyers are already in the</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.710" end="00:30:36.912" style="s2">development lab.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.410" end="00:30:39.012" style="s2">If we can&#39;t deliver the test</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.912" end="00:30:40.312" style="s2">the contract says we owe $20 million in</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.012" end="00:30:42.712" style="s2">penalties.</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.312" end="00:30:42.712" style="s2">What do we do?</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.012" end="00:30:47.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t patch the vulnerability directly.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.812" end="00:30:49.212" style="s2">Use an adversary sandbox to isolate the</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.612" end="00:30:50.312" style="s2">entire validation module in a separate</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.212" end="00:30:52.412" style="s2">container.</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.312" end="00:30:54.112" style="s2">Rebuild a micro environment inside it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.412" end="00:30:56.012" style="s2">Then lower the test case&#39;s privileges to</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.112" end="00:30:58.012" style="s2">ring three and run the entire suite in a</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.012" end="00:30:59.212" style="s2">user mode simulation. That way, the</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.012" end="00:31:01.812" style="s2">vulnerability can&#39;t reach the core</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.212" end="00:31:01.812" style="s2">processes.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.512" end="00:31:07.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who told you to mess with that? It&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.112" end="00:31:09.912" style="s2">$20 million penalty. You couldn&#39;t pay</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.512" end="00:31:12.412" style="s2">that off in a lifetime.</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.912" end="00:31:13.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what if this works?</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.412" end="00:31:14.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it works, I&#39;ll accept you as my</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.412" end="00:31:18.312" style="s2">sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.612" end="00:31:18.312" style="s2">From then on, whatever you say goes.</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.812" end="00:31:31.712" style="s2">It&#39;s actually fixed.</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.412" end="00:31:33.412" style="s2">Mr. Nate,</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.712" end="00:31:35.112" style="s2">word from the development lab. The</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.412" end="00:31:37.212" style="s2">system is up and running.</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.112" end="00:31:39.912" style="s2">Our partners are thrilled with the data.</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.212" end="00:31:41.712" style="s2">They&#39;re increasing their investment.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.912" end="00:31:44.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can actually do all that?</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.712" end="00:31:47.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you. I know a little about IT.</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.912" end="00:31:48.112" style="s2">Time to keep your promise.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.212" end="00:31:50.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What promise?</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.112" end="00:31:53.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say it. I&#39;m your sister-in-law. And from</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.512" end="00:31:55.212" style="s2">now on, you listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.512" end="00:31:57.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.212" end="00:31:57.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good boy.</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.112" end="00:32:01.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who does she think she is?</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.512" end="00:32:03.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She just got lucky.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.512" end="00:32:05.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Nate, that bug was incredibly</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.112" end="00:32:08.612" style="s2">difficult to fix. That wasn&#39;t luck.</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.812" end="00:32:08.612" style="s2">She&#39;s the real deal.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.212" end="00:32:17.912" style="s2">Find out everything about her.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.812" end="00:32:21.012" style="s2">If she wants to be part of this family,</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.912" end="00:32:21.012" style="s2">she&#39;ll have to prove she&#39;s up to it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.912" end="00:32:28.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nate, why did you drag us out here?</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.112" end="00:32:29.912" style="s2">We&#39;ve been waiting forever.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.112" end="00:32:31.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a little longer.</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.912" end="00:32:32.412" style="s2">Mr. Gray can&#39;t stand it when people are</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.512" end="00:32:34.712" style="s2">late.</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.412" end="00:32:37.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now he&#39;s waiting for someone</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.712" end="00:32:39.713" style="s2">who could get him to bend his own rules.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.112" end="00:32:39.713" style="s2">I&#39;d I&#39;d to know.</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.713" end="00:32:43.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen, she&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.613" end="00:32:47.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen, why did you bring some hired help</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.313" end="00:32:49.413" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.113" end="00:32:52.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paige, this is my wife, Lyla.</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.413" end="00:32:52.513" style="s2">Speak to her with respect.</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.882" end="00:32:56.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.213" end="00:32:56.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen, you married that? Are you blind?</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.513" end="00:33:03.113" style="s2">You threw that at me?</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.613" end="00:33:06.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Disrespect Lyla again,</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.113" end="00:33:06.613" style="s2">and next time it&#39;ll be my fist.</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.313" end="00:33:10.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen,</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.313" end="00:33:11.913" style="s2">you hit me over some woman who works odd</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.813" end="00:33:14.913" style="s2">jobs?</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.913" end="00:33:14.913" style="s2">Have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.213" end="00:33:18.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen,</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.213" end="00:33:18.813" style="s2">don&#39;t get upset.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.413" end="00:33:23.013" style="s2">I do work odd jobs.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.213" end="00:33:25.013" style="s2">She&#39;s not wrong about that.</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.013" end="00:33:27.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care about your past.</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.013" end="00:33:28.613" style="s2">You&#39;re my wife now.</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.013" end="00:33:29.813" style="s2">Anyone who hurts you</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.613" end="00:33:32.113" style="s2">will pay for it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.813" end="00:33:35.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It feels so good</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.113" end="00:33:38.713" style="s2">to have someone looking out for me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.213" end="00:33:38.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can hear you shouting from outside.</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.013" end="00:33:41.113" style="s2">What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.213" end="00:33:43.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.113" end="00:33:44.713" style="s2">Galen hit me over some woman who works</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.413" end="00:33:48.013" style="s2">odd jobs.</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.713" end="00:33:48.013" style="s2">He&#39;s completely lost it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.413" end="00:33:50.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You and Paige may not be related by</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.813" end="00:33:52.913" style="s2">blood,</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.813" end="00:33:54.113" style="s2">but you grew up under the same roof.</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.913" end="00:33:55.913" style="s2">You&#39;re family.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.113" end="00:33:57.113" style="s2">Hitting her over an outsider is going</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.913" end="00:33:59.913" style="s2">too far.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.113" end="00:34:01.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lyla isn&#39;t an outsider. She&#39;s my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.913" end="00:34:04.513" style="s2">She&#39;s my real family.</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.413" end="00:34:06.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you out of your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.513" end="00:34:09.613" style="s2">You married a woman</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.113" end="00:34:11.213" style="s2">who scrapes by on odd jobs?</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.613" end="00:34:13.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care how you tricked Galen into</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.213" end="00:34:15.813" style="s2">marrying you. I will never accept you as</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.613" end="00:34:18.313" style="s2">the new Mrs. Gray.</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.813" end="00:34:19.613" style="s2">Get out. Now. Do you hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.313" end="00:34:21.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you come in here and make</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.613" end="00:34:23.313" style="s2">demands?</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.513" end="00:34:25.613" style="s2">Would you have adopted us if you weren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.313" end="00:34:27.203" style="s2">after our parents&#39; business?</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.613" end="00:34:29.313" style="s2">She isn&#39;t the one who needs to get out.</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.203" end="00:34:30.913" style="s2">[music] You are.</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.313" end="00:34:34.713" style="s2">You and your useless daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.913" end="00:34:34.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you talk to us like that?</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.213" end="00:34:38.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you hear yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.813" end="00:34:40.313" style="s2">If I hadn&#39;t taken you boys in, you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.613" end="00:34:41.314" style="s2">have ended up on the streets.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.313" end="00:34:42.414" style="s2">God knows what would have happened to</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.314" end="00:34:44.214" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.414" end="00:34:46.314" style="s2">Even if you won&#39;t thank me</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.214" end="00:34:48.714" style="s2">for everything I&#39;ve done, you have no</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.314" end="00:34:51.014" style="s2">reason to treat me like an enemy.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.714" end="00:34:55.014" style="s2">You&#39;re turning on me over some woman who</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.014" end="00:34:57.714" style="s2">works odd jobs? Are you insane?</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.014" end="00:35:00.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.714" end="00:35:03.714" style="s2">The woman I&#39;m spending my life with.</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.914" end="00:35:07.014" style="s2">She matters more to me than anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.714" end="00:35:07.014" style="s2">None of you even come close.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.414" end="00:35:12.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You actually threw that at her?</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.814" end="00:35:15.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s the reason you think you can talk</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.314" end="00:35:17.914" style="s2">to me like this</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.714" end="00:35:19.214" style="s2">and hit your own sister.</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.914" end="00:35:21.314" style="s2">She isn&#39;t getting away with it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.214" end="00:35:22.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Miller, you attacked me. How is this</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.314" end="00:35:25.714" style="s2">my fault?</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.914" end="00:35:27.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who gave you the right to speak to me?</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.714" end="00:35:28.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who am I supposed to speak to then?</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.464" end="00:35:29.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.014" end="00:35:30.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glane,</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.214" end="00:35:32.714" style="s2">this is the woman you married?</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.914" end="00:35:33.914" style="s2">No manners, no class. She&#39;s nothing but</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.714" end="00:35:36.814" style="s2">trash.</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.914" end="00:35:39.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glane, how dare you attack my father?</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.814" end="00:35:40.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scared now that you&#39;re the target?</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.014" end="00:35:42.414" style="s2">Anyone who goes after my wife</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.914" end="00:35:44.614" style="s2">answers to me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.414" end="00:35:45.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get to act like this.</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.614" end="00:35:46.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen,</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.814" end="00:35:48.214" style="s2">take a good look at the woman you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.814" end="00:35:50.314" style="s2">chosen.</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.214" end="00:35:51.614" style="s2">Every woman we wanted you to marry came</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.314" end="00:35:53.314" style="s2">from one of San Francisco&#39;s most</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.614" end="00:35:54.414" style="s2">prominent families.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.314" end="00:35:55.614" style="s2">Anyone of them would have been better</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.414" end="00:35:59.114" style="s2">than her.</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.614" end="00:35:59.114" style="s2">What can she possibly do for you?</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.214" end="00:36:06.714" style="s2">This is a private vineyard. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.814" end="00:36:08.114" style="s2">just walk in.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.714" end="00:36:10.414" style="s2">We&#39;re here with project offers for Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.114" end="00:36:10.414" style="s2">Anderson.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.814" end="00:36:16.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glane, you proposed to her.</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.514" end="00:36:18.214" style="s2">What did she give you in return?</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.414" end="00:36:20.614" style="s2">An old newspaper?</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.214" end="00:36:22.614" style="s2">A pile of scrap metal?</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.614" end="00:36:25.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care what she can do for me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.614" end="00:36:25.714" style="s2">I care about who she is.</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.414" end="00:36:29.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just because you don&#39;t care doesn&#39;t mean</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.714" end="00:36:30.714" style="s2">the rest of us agree.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.314" end="00:36:32.314" style="s2">Ask anyone here whether your marriage</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.714" end="00:36:34.514" style="s2">should benefit the company.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.314" end="00:36:35.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glane, anyone of the irises your mother</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.514" end="00:36:37.914" style="s2">picked out for you could have helped</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.814" end="00:36:40.114" style="s2">this company grow.</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.914" end="00:36:42.714" style="s2">You turned them all down and married</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.114" end="00:36:45.516" style="s2">someone who does menial work and now you</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.714" end="00:36:48.216" style="s2">want to bring her into the company?</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.516" end="00:36:49.516" style="s2">The board will never allow it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.216" end="00:36:50.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Know your place.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.516" end="00:36:53.016" style="s2">If you&#39;re broke,</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.716" end="00:36:55.016" style="s2">stay single. Don&#39;t marry a man and make</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.016" end="00:36:57.916" style="s2">him a laughing stock, too.</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.016" end="00:37:01.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t belong in our world.</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.916" end="00:37:03.216" style="s2">Stop dreaming of moving up.</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.216" end="00:37:05.416" style="s2">Leave while you still can.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.216" end="00:37:08.316" style="s2">And I might find you somewhere nicer</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.416" end="00:37:11.016" style="s2">to do your little odd jobs.</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.316" end="00:37:13.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe I&#39;m not on your level yet.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.016" end="00:37:17.216" style="s2">But how can you be so sure</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.716" end="00:37:17.216" style="s2">I&#39;ll never make something of myself?</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.916" end="00:37:23.916" style="s2">I can&#39;t promise how successful I&#39;ll be,</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.716" end="00:37:25.916" style="s2">but I will never be a burden to Gallon.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.916" end="00:37:27.616" style="s2">Spare us the big promises.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.916" end="00:37:29.416" style="s2">Anyone can talk.</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.616" end="00:37:32.816" style="s2">If you&#39;re so capable,</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.416" end="00:37:32.816" style="s2">do something for the company.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.116" end="00:37:44.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re here with project offers for Miss</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.516" end="00:37:44.916" style="s2">Anderson.</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.716" end="00:37:51.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Lila. Sorry, who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.016" end="00:37:52.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Anderson, I&#39;m Miss Wilson&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.216" end="00:37:53.316" style="s2">assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.216" end="00:37:55.016" style="s2">She&#39;s asked me to award her next three</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.316" end="00:37:56.816" style="s2">projects to Gray Tech.</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.016" end="00:37:58.716" style="s2">I&#39;m Miss Chapman&#39;s assistant. She asked</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.816" end="00:37:59.616" style="s2">me to tell you that as long as you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.716" end="00:38:01.316" style="s2">here,</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.616" end="00:38:02.916" style="s2">Gray Tech will be our partner on these</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.316" end="00:38:04.216" style="s2">projects.</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.916" end="00:38:06.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re behind this?</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.216" end="00:38:09.016" style="s2">I had no idea.</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.816" end="00:38:10.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You barged into a private vineyard. Who</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.016" end="00:38:12.016" style="s2">do you think you are?</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.316" end="00:38:14.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They work for friends of mine. People</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.016" end="00:38:15.916" style="s2">who work odd jobs have assistants now?</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.116" end="00:38:17.616" style="s2">What a joke. Your friends are all</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.916" end="00:38:20.816" style="s2">bottom-of-the-barrel trash, and they</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.616" end="00:38:20.816" style="s2">think they can bring us projects?</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.316" end="00:38:24.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paige Gray, the Gray family heiress. You</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.716" end="00:38:26.216" style="s2">claim you attended a prestigious</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.816" end="00:38:29.116" style="s2">university in Europe, but it was</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.216" end="00:38:29.116" style="s2">actually a diploma mill.</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.116" end="00:38:35.516" style="s2">The only reason you got a job at Gray</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.616" end="00:38:37.616" style="s2">Tech after graduation</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.516" end="00:38:39.716" style="s2">was your mother&#39;s shares in the company.</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.616" end="00:38:41.216" style="s2">You&#39;re as useless as they come.</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.716" end="00:38:44.516" style="s2">Who the hell do you think you are</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.216" end="00:38:44.516" style="s2">TALKING ABOUT MY DAUGHTER LIKE THAT?</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.916" end="00:38:47.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GRAY GRAY HAS BEEN STRUGGLING TO LAND</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.116" end="00:38:49.517" style="s2">partnerships since last year.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.917" end="00:38:50.517" style="s2">If it weren&#39;t for Ms. Anderson,</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.517" end="00:38:51.817" style="s2">your company wouldn&#39;t even be under</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.517" end="00:38:53.717" style="s2">consideration.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.817" end="00:38:56.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S A LOAD OF LIES!</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.717" end="00:38:57.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think bringing in a couple of people</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.017" end="00:38:59.517" style="s2">to talk you up</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.617" end="00:39:01.717" style="s2">will change what we think of you?</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.517" end="00:39:03.217" style="s2">You work odd jobs. Get real. You&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.717" end="00:39:05.017" style="s2">always be trash.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.217" end="00:39:07.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you to question Ms. Anderson?</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.017" end="00:39:09.417" style="s2">Soon you&#39;ll be begging her to stay at</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.017" end="00:39:09.417" style="s2">Gray Tech.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.917" end="00:39:13.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leila, how do you know these men?</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.417" end="00:39:14.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My brother just proposed to you and</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.217" end="00:39:16.217" style="s2">you&#39;ve already got other guys showing up</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.617" end="00:39:17.517" style="s2">looking for you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.217" end="00:39:19.617" style="s2">You&#39;re a real piece of work.</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.517" end="00:39:21.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not what you think.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.617" end="00:39:22.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gail, you just said you married her</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.217" end="00:39:24.217" style="s2">because of her character.</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.817" end="00:39:25.917" style="s2">Is this what you meant?</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.217" end="00:39:27.417" style="s2">Marrying someone who works odd jobs was</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.917" end="00:39:29.017" style="s2">embarrassing enough.</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.417" end="00:39:30.217" style="s2">Now it turns out she&#39;s a cheater, too.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.017" end="00:39:32.117" style="s2">That&#39;s priceless.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.217" end="00:39:33.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not true. I didn&#39;t You think</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.117" end="00:39:35.717" style="s2">we&#39;ll beg someone</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.517" end="00:39:36.817" style="s2">who works odd jobs to stay at Gray Tech?</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.717" end="00:39:37.817" style="s2">That&#39;s the funniest thing I&#39;ve ever</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.817" end="00:39:39.917" style="s2">heard.</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.817" end="00:39:40.717" style="s2">Do broke losers like you do anything but</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.917" end="00:39:42.317" style="s2">talk big?</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.717" end="00:39:45.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Gray is an exceptionally capable</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.317" end="00:39:46.317" style="s2">CEO. Our CEO has always admired him. The</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.317" end="00:39:47.517" style="s2">only reason she hasn&#39;t partnered with</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.317" end="00:39:48.817" style="s2">this company</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.517" end="00:39:49.717" style="s2">is the dead weight like you dragging it</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.817" end="00:39:51.117" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.717" end="00:39:52.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s right. If it weren&#39;t for Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.117" end="00:39:56.117" style="s2">Anderson, we wouldn&#39;t work with you</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.517" end="00:39:58.217" style="s2">either. Consider yourselves lucky.</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.117" end="00:40:01.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. Keep up the act. Let&#39;s see how</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.217" end="00:40:01.117" style="s2">long you can pull it off.</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.217" end="00:40:05.617" style="s2">Mrs. Wilson, how is that possible?</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.117" end="00:40:07.117" style="s2">This is the S Chip partner.</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.617" end="00:40:08.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The S Chip partnership?</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.117" end="00:40:10.017" style="s2">We couldn&#39;t get that deal no matter how</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.517" end="00:40:12.917" style="s2">hard we begged.</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.017" end="00:40:14.017" style="s2">Now they&#39;re offering it to us?</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.917" end="00:40:15.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Chapman,</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.017" end="00:40:18.317" style="s2">her latest cloud computing project.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.717" end="00:40:19.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This project is worth a billion dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.317" end="00:40:21.217" style="s2">It could take the company to the next</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.417" end="00:40:22.617" style="s2">level.</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.217" end="00:40:24.717" style="s2">Ms. Wilson and Ms. Chapman are two of</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.617" end="00:40:26.217" style="s2">the biggest names in Silicon Valley. Why</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.717" end="00:40:28.517" style="s2">would they send their assistants here</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.217" end="00:40:29.717" style="s2">with letters of intent?</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.517" end="00:40:31.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Wilson would never offer you these</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.717" end="00:40:33.517" style="s2">projects if Ms. Anderson weren&#39;t at Gray</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.917" end="00:40:36.317" style="s2">Tech. Whether we move forward with the</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.517" end="00:40:37.917" style="s2">deal is entirely up to Ms. Anderson.</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.317" end="00:40:39.517" style="s2">Same goes for us. We&#39;ll partner with</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.917" end="00:40:41.817" style="s2">whichever company Ms. Anderson works</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.517" end="00:40:41.817" style="s2">for.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.317" end="00:40:46.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know two of the biggest names</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.517" end="00:40:47.817" style="s2">in Silicon Valley?</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.417" end="00:40:50.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They want to work with you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.817" end="00:40:52.018" style="s2">So go ahead. You can trust them.</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.318" end="00:40:54.418" style="s2">As for how I know them,</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.018" end="00:40:56.218" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell you when the time is right.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.418" end="00:40:57.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. I won&#39;t push. So these</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.218" end="00:41:00.118" style="s2">projects are your gift</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.718" end="00:41:00.118" style="s2">to me in return.</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.918" end="00:41:05.218" style="s2">Does anyone still think Layla</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.018" end="00:41:07.018" style="s2">isn&#39;t good enough to be my wife?</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.218" end="00:41:08.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have excellent taste, Mr. Gray. You</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.018" end="00:41:10.518" style="s2">and Ms. Anderson are a perfect match. We</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.418" end="00:41:11.918" style="s2">have no objections whatsoever.</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.518" end="00:41:13.818" style="s2">Absolutely.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.918" end="00:41:14.918" style="s2">Layla is Mrs. Gray now, and no one at</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.818" end="00:41:16.818" style="s2">Gray Tech</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.918" end="00:41:19.518" style="s2">is going to mistreat her.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.818" end="00:41:19.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely.</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.718" end="00:41:25.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Gray, I&#39;m sure this will be a very</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.418" end="00:41:25.318" style="s2">successful partnership.</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.018" end="00:41:29.718" style="s2">Gray Tech won&#39;t let you down.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.618" end="00:41:30.818" style="s2">Please give both your CEOs my regards.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.718" end="00:41:32.018" style="s2">Ms. Anderson,</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.818" end="00:41:34.418" style="s2">we&#39;ve done what we came to do. We&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.018" end="00:41:34.418" style="s2">on our way.</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.118" end="00:41:39.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, why would two Silicon Valley giants</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.118" end="00:41:40.418" style="s2">partner with us because of Layla?</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.218" end="00:41:42.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I refuse to believe someone who works</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.418" end="00:41:44.618" style="s2">odd jobs has connections like that in</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.218" end="00:41:47.718" style="s2">Silicon Valley.</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.618" end="00:41:47.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, do you think the deals are fake?</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.118" end="00:41:56.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Gray, I have the background report</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.718" end="00:41:56.218" style="s2">on Layla.</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.218" end="00:42:02.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You investigated me?</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.518" end="00:42:05.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nate, why did you run a background check</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.718" end="00:42:07.418" style="s2">on Layla?</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.518" end="00:42:08.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glenn, I just wanted to know more about</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.418" end="00:42:11.318" style="s2">her, you know,</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.718" end="00:42:11.318" style="s2">so we&#39;d get along better.</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.018" end="00:42:18.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give that back. What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.918" end="00:42:20.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why were you so quick to send your</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.918" end="00:42:22.718" style="s2">assistant away?</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.918" end="00:42:25.218" style="s2">Did he dig up something bad?</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.718" end="00:42:28.418" style="s2">Something you don&#39;t want us to see?</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.218" end="00:42:28.418" style="s2">Let&#39;s find out what&#39;s really going on.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.518" end="00:42:32.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop making things up.</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.618" end="00:42:34.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One look inside and we&#39;ll know if I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.918" end="00:42:35.818" style="s2">making it up.</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.418" end="00:42:38.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Layla has ties to two Silicon Valley</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.818" end="00:42:40.318" style="s2">giants, yet she works odd jobs.</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.418" end="00:42:42.818" style="s2">Now that&#39;s an interesting story.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.318" end="00:42:44.718" style="s2">Why not let us all take a look?</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.818" end="00:42:46.418" style="s2">Whatever Layla&#39;s past may be, she&#39;s my</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.718" end="00:42:49.218" style="s2">wife now.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.418" end="00:42:49.218" style="s2">None of you gets to judge her.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.918" end="00:42:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you so nervous?</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.818" end="00:42:54.220" style="s2">Is there something in here you need to</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.720" end="00:42:56.620" style="s2">hide?</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.220" end="00:42:59.820" style="s2">Or was that whole performance a setup?</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.620" end="00:43:01.120" style="s2">Maybe those deals don&#39;t even exist.</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.820" end="00:43:02.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paige is right.</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.120" end="00:43:04.120" style="s2">Two Silicon Valley giants wouldn&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.420" end="00:43:06.120" style="s2">anything to do with a woman who scrapes</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.120" end="00:43:07.120" style="s2">by on odd jobs. Could those deals really</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.120" end="00:43:08.520" style="s2">be fake?</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.120" end="00:43:09.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lawrence has a point. We may have been</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.520" end="00:43:12.320" style="s2">fooled.</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.920" end="00:43:14.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just had to make a mess of things.</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.320" end="00:43:16.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t done anything wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.120" end="00:43:18.320" style="s2">If they want to look, let them.</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.820" end="00:43:20.220" style="s2">Still putting on an act?</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.320" end="00:43:23.520" style="s2">Let&#39;s see what someone who does odd jobs</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.220" end="00:43:23.520" style="s2">could possibly have accomplished.</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.120" end="00:43:28.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Read it out loud, Paige. Let&#39;s hear what</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.220" end="00:43:29.420" style="s2">this woman who lives off odd jobs has</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.720" end="00:43:31.620" style="s2">achieved.</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.420" end="00:43:33.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lila Anderson, orphaned, raised at</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.620" end="00:43:35.320" style="s2">Sacred Heart Children&#39;s Home, awarded a</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.320" end="00:43:36.420" style="s2">full scholarship to MIT five years ago,</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.320" end="00:43:38.120" style="s2">majored in computer science and</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.420" end="00:43:40.420" style="s2">artificial intelligence with a minor in</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.120" end="00:43:41.820" style="s2">quantum computing. Freshman year, North</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.420" end="00:43:43.920" style="s2">American champion in the International</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.820" end="00:43:45.420" style="s2">Collegiate Programming Contest.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.920" end="00:43:46.720" style="s2">Sophomore year, sole author of a paper</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.420" end="00:43:48.520" style="s2">on privacy-protecting algorithms for</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.720" end="00:43:51.020" style="s2">federated learning, cited over 2,000</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.520" end="00:43:52.420" style="s2">times. Junior year, represented MIT in</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.020" end="00:43:54.120" style="s2">the Global AI Safety Challenge and won</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.420" end="00:43:55.520" style="s2">gold. Senior year, developed a</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.120" end="00:43:56.920" style="s2">distributed training framework that was</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.520" end="00:43:59.620" style="s2">adopted as a core project by the Open</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.920" end="00:43:59.620" style="s2">Source Foundation.</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.020" end="00:44:03.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lila, I had no idea you&#39;d accomplished</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.220" end="00:44:04.420" style="s2">so much.</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.220" end="00:44:06.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t a big deal. I just entered a</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.420" end="00:44:07.920" style="s2">few competitions for the prize money.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.720" end="00:44:09.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won the International Collegiate</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.920" end="00:44:11.020" style="s2">Programming Contest. In 20 years, no</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.720" end="00:44:13.620" style="s2">woman had ever won the North American</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.020" end="00:44:15.120" style="s2">title before you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.620" end="00:44:17.020" style="s2">I read that paper on federated learning.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.120" end="00:44:18.120" style="s2">She wrote it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.020" end="00:44:19.320" style="s2">We&#39;re incredibly lucky to have someone</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.120" end="00:44:20.420" style="s2">this brilliant</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.320" end="00:44:22.420" style="s2">at Great Tech.</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.420" end="00:44:23.820" style="s2">With your tech skills, why</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.420" end="00:44:24.620" style="s2">were you working odd jobs?</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.820" end="00:44:25.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, it was because</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.620" end="00:44:27.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were working those jobs to fund</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.720" end="00:44:29.220" style="s2">Simon&#39;s startup.</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.520" end="00:44:30.920" style="s2">You didn&#39;t even have time</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.220" end="00:44:32.220" style="s2">to interview at the big company.</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.920" end="00:44:33.220" style="s2">Does anyone still object to Lila being</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.220" end="00:44:35.220" style="s2">my wife?</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.220" end="00:44:36.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.220" end="00:44:39.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To my wife, Lila, and her place by my</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.720" end="00:44:41.420" style="s2">side at Great Tech. Cheers.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.020" end="00:44:41.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cheers.</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.020" end="00:44:47.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank God they didn&#39;t find out I&#39;m X.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.020" end="00:44:49.020" style="s2">The AI system isn&#39;t quite ready yet.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.320" end="00:44:51.120" style="s2">If they found out now, it would ruin my</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.020" end="00:44:53.020" style="s2">surprise for Galen.</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.120" end="00:44:55.521" style="s2">Dad, Galen already refuses to listen to</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.020" end="00:44:57.121" style="s2">us now. He&#39;s married a genius. How are</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.521" end="00:44:58.821" style="s2">we supposed to keep him under control?</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.121" end="00:45:00.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. Your mother is Graitech&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.821" end="00:45:01.721" style="s2">second largest shareholder. We&#39;ll talk</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.421" end="00:45:02.621" style="s2">to her when we get home.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.721" end="00:45:04.621" style="s2">We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.621" end="00:45:05.521" style="s2">find a way.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.621" end="00:45:06.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not getting away with this,</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.521" end="00:45:07.921" style="s2">Galvin.</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.521" end="00:45:10.721" style="s2">And Lisa,</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.921" end="00:45:10.721" style="s2">you&#39;re going to pay.</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.621" end="00:45:16.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were amazing today.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.421" end="00:45:19.321" style="s2">You deserve a top-of-the-line laptop.</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.821" end="00:45:19.321" style="s2">What do you think?</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.021" end="00:45:29.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s incredibly fast. More than enough</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.221" end="00:45:29.021" style="s2">power for any program I&#39;d want to run.</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.421" end="00:45:33.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen,</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.321" end="00:45:35.521" style="s2">she gets a top-of-the-line laptop</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.421" end="00:45:38.121" style="s2">and I can&#39;t even touch the mouse?</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.521" end="00:45:40.421" style="s2">You&#39;re really going to complain?</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.121" end="00:45:42.021" style="s2">We wouldn&#39;t have had that mess today</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.421" end="00:45:44.321" style="s2">if you hadn&#39;t investigated Layla behind</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.021" end="00:45:46.621" style="s2">our backs.</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.321" end="00:45:48.521" style="s2">You&#39;re lucky she&#39;s so accomplished.</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.621" end="00:45:50.721" style="s2">Otherwise,</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.521" end="00:45:52.221" style="s2">we&#39;d have been in real trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.721" end="00:45:53.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s young.</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.221" end="00:45:55.721" style="s2">It&#39;s only natural he doesn&#39;t always</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.721" end="00:45:58.421" style="s2">think things through.</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.721" end="00:46:01.021" style="s2">Give him a break.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.421" end="00:46:03.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need you sticking up for me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.021" end="00:46:05.121" style="s2">Nate, don&#39;t talk to Layla like that.</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.321" end="00:46:06.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, Galen.</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.121" end="00:46:08.121" style="s2">So she&#39;s a straight A student?</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.921" end="00:46:10.221" style="s2">Big deal.</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.121" end="00:46:12.121" style="s2">She&#39;s nothing compared to X.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.221" end="00:46:14.221" style="s2">If I ever meet X,</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.121" end="00:46:15.621" style="s2">I&#39;m going to marry her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.221" end="00:46:17.232" style="s2">Then Layla won&#39;t even be in the same</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.621" end="00:46:19.252" style="s2">league.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.232" end="00:46:19.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.921" end="00:46:29.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.921" end="00:46:31.621" style="s2">What&#39;s with the coughing?</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.821" end="00:46:33.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just swallowed wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.621" end="00:46:35.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not sticking around to watch you two</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.021" end="00:46:35.921" style="s2">get all lovey-dovey.</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.821" end="00:46:45.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got some nerve, Galen. Get back</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.021" end="00:46:48.321" style="s2">to the estate now.</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.221" end="00:46:48.321" style="s2">I have questions for you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.921" end="00:46:52.921" style="s2">Galen, I&#39;m coming with you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.821" end="00:47:01.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m bothering you?</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.723" end="00:47:05.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every time I stand here, I think about</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.122" end="00:47:07.922" style="s2">who&#39;s living inside</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.823" end="00:47:10.023" style="s2">my parents&#39; friends,</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.922" end="00:47:11.323" style="s2">people they trusted to take care of me,</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.023" end="00:47:13.122" style="s2">who ended up taking everything they left</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.323" end="00:47:14.422" style="s2">behind.</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.122" end="00:47:17.922" style="s2">It still hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.422" end="00:47:17.922" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry about me. I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.122" end="00:47:21.523" style="s2">Sooner or later, I&#39;ll get it all back.</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.122" end="00:47:25.523" style="s2">Let&#39;s go in.</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.523" end="00:47:40.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gail, you little bastard.</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.023" end="00:47:43.922" style="s2">When was the last time you came home?</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.723" end="00:47:46.723" style="s2">Do you even remember this is your house?</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.922" end="00:47:49.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is my house,</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.723" end="00:47:52.523" style="s2">but none of the people</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.223" end="00:47:55.523" style="s2">living here are my family.</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.523" end="00:47:55.523" style="s2">Why would I come back?</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.723" end="00:48:02.023" style="s2">Why did you call me here?</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.223" end="00:48:03.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;re the woman Galen married?</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.023" end="00:48:04.223" style="s2">The one who works odd jobs?</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.723" end="00:48:05.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Gray.</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.223" end="00:48:07.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.422" end="00:48:09.723" style="s2">try to get close to me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.223" end="00:48:11.922" style="s2">You&#39;re no family of mine.</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.723" end="00:48:14.922" style="s2">You work odd jobs and you think my</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.922" end="00:48:17.823" style="s2">mother would ever approve of you?</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.922" end="00:48:20.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think you belong in the Gray family?</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.823" end="00:48:21.823" style="s2">Take a good look at yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.323" end="00:48:23.622" style="s2">Keep dreaming.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.823" end="00:48:25.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother is Gray Tech&#39;s second largest</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.622" end="00:48:27.023" style="s2">shareholder.</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.223" end="00:48:29.023" style="s2">Without her approval, you can forget</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.023" end="00:48:31.323" style="s2">about taking your place beside Galen at</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.023" end="00:48:33.023" style="s2">the company.</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.323" end="00:48:36.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As of tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.023" end="00:48:39.223" style="s2">you&#39;re not setting foot in Gray Tech.</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.323" end="00:48:39.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.523" end="00:48:43.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If my own wife doesn&#39;t belong by my side</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.023" end="00:48:45.422" style="s2">at Gray Tech, what gives you the right</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.922" end="00:48:47.023" style="s2">to work there?</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.422" end="00:48:48.823" style="s2">Seems only fair</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.023" end="00:48:51.323" style="s2">to kick you out.</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.823" end="00:48:51.323" style="s2">Don&#39;t you think?</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.723" end="00:48:56.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What gives you the right to kick my</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.723" end="00:48:58.823" style="s2">daughter out of Gray Tech?</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.922" end="00:49:00.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Gray Tech&#39;s largest shareholder.</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.823" end="00:49:02.224" style="s2">That&#39;s what gives me the right.</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.424" end="00:49:04.724" style="s2">You come after my wife,</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.224" end="00:49:05.824" style="s2">I come after your daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.724" end="00:49:08.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.824" end="00:49:09.924" style="s2">Galen can&#39;t treat me like this.</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.124" end="00:49:12.124" style="s2">You have to stand up for me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.924" end="00:49:14.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I poured everything I had</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.124" end="00:49:16.424" style="s2">into raising you and your brother. And</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.524" end="00:49:18.424" style="s2">this is how you repay me?</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.424" end="00:49:20.424" style="s2">Have you no conscience?</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.424" end="00:49:22.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would you have adopted my brother and us</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.424" end="00:49:24.824" style="s2">if we hadn&#39;t come with a fortune?</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.424" end="00:49:27.424" style="s2">Stop acting like some saint. It makes me</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.824" end="00:49:27.424" style="s2">sick.</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.024" end="00:49:33.424" style="s2">Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.324" end="00:49:34.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. It doesn&#39;t hurt. I can take</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.424" end="00:49:36.824" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.424" end="00:49:39.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trash will always be trash.</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.824" end="00:49:42.924" style="s2">Worthless. Every last one of them. Slap</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.524" end="00:49:42.924" style="s2">them and they don&#39;t even feel it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.324" end="00:49:49.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.324" end="00:49:49.024" style="s2">If you weren&#39;t such a cheap</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.124" end="00:49:52.924" style="s2">how else would you have ended up</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.224" end="00:49:54.924" style="s2">in Garen&#39;s bed?</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.924" end="00:49:57.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen, how dare you kick me?</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.924" end="00:50:00.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, look what Galen did to me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.724" end="00:50:02.524" style="s2">He kicked me. It hurt so much.</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.724" end="00:50:03.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen, have you lost your mind? She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.524" end="00:50:05.424" style="s2">your sister.</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.624" end="00:50:07.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You slap my wife,</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.424" end="00:50:10.024" style="s2">I kick your daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.324" end="00:50:10.024" style="s2">Seems fair to me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.224" end="00:50:14.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re so determined to make this day</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.724" end="00:50:16.424" style="s2">laborer your wife, fine.</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.224" end="00:50:19.424" style="s2">But there&#39;s one thing</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.424" end="00:50:19.424" style="s2">you have to do first.</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.924" end="00:50:24.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.824" end="00:50:27.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The night air is looking to fund a major</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.624" end="00:50:30.524" style="s2">project in Silicon Valley.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.524" end="00:50:33.224" style="s2">Land that deal and I&#39;ll accept that</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.524" end="00:50:36.124" style="s2">useless day laborer as the woman at your</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.224" end="00:50:36.124" style="s2">side at Grey Tech.</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.824" end="00:50:42.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those deals you landed today are nothing</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.324" end="00:50:43.124" style="s2">compared to what the Knight family is</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.124" end="00:50:44.524" style="s2">offering.</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.124" end="00:50:47.524" style="s2">The Knight deal.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.524" end="00:50:49.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong, Galen? Scared?</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.524" end="00:50:51.924" style="s2">Then take that piece of trash and get</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.724" end="00:50:53.924" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.924" end="00:50:55.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s raise the stakes.</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.924" end="00:50:57.524" style="s2">If I land it,</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.324" end="00:50:59.324" style="s2">you get out of Grey Tech.</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.524" end="00:51:00.924" style="s2">And take your idiot daughter and that</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.324" end="00:51:02.815" style="s2">husband who can&#39;t even balance the books</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.924" end="00:51:04.525" style="s2">with Scared?</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.815" end="00:51:06.025" style="s2">[snorts] Won&#39;t take the bet?</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.525" end="00:51:08.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.025" end="00:51:10.025" style="s2">But if you don&#39; land the deal,</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.225" end="00:51:11.925" style="s2">you hand over every share you own.</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.025" end="00:51:14.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a deal.</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.925" end="00:51:14.225" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.725" end="00:51:21.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen, don&#39;t put so much pressure on</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.725" end="00:51:24.825" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.525" end="00:51:24.825" style="s2">Have a little faith in yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.025" end="00:51:28.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The night air is notoriously hard to</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.825" end="00:51:30.425" style="s2">please.</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.325" end="00:51:33.425" style="s2">This version has to be flawless if we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.425" end="00:51:33.425" style="s2">going to land that deal.</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.225" end="00:51:39.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no such thing as flawless</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.025" end="00:51:41.725" style="s2">software.</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.125" end="00:51:44.925" style="s2">A lot of bugs are inevitable. Our job is</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.725" end="00:51:47.725" style="s2">to catch them and fix them in time.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.925" end="00:51:49.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care what anyone thinks of you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.725" end="00:51:52.325" style="s2">You&#39;re the woman I chose</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.625" end="00:51:52.325" style="s2">to be my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.725" end="00:52:14.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no, I promised I&#39;d go with Galen to</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.425" end="00:52:14.225" style="s2">the pitch. I&#39;m going to be late.</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.425" end="00:52:18.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re finally awake.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.025" end="00:52:26.125" style="s2">I was starting to think</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.625" end="00:52:28.725" style="s2">you died in your sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.125" end="00:52:31.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All these clothes?</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.725" end="00:52:33.225" style="s2">Did you move an entire boutique in here?</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.625" end="00:52:36.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen got all of these for you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.225" end="00:52:36.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re all for me?</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.925" end="00:52:45.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who else? Look at the few worn-out</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.225" end="00:52:47.925" style="s2">things you own.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.525" end="00:52:49.725" style="s2">Which one were you planning to wear</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.925" end="00:52:51.825" style="s2">to meet the night air?</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.725" end="00:52:54.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A few outfits would have been plenty.</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.825" end="00:52:54.625" style="s2">I don&#39;t need all this.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.325" end="00:52:58.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen&#39;s waiting for you at Monet</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.525" end="00:53:00.425" style="s2">Gallery.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.725" end="00:53:03.325" style="s2">Come on, get changed.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.425" end="00:53:03.325" style="s2">We don&#39;t have all day.</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.627" end="00:53:12.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m so sorry I&#39;m late.</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.327" end="00:53:16.327" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.827" end="00:53:17.427" style="s2">Is there something wrong with the dress?</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.327" end="00:53:18.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.427" end="00:53:21.127" style="s2">I just wasn&#39;t prepared for how beautiful</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.927" end="00:53:22.627" style="s2">you look.</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.127" end="00:53:24.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How good do you think our chances are</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.627" end="00:53:26.427" style="s2">with the program we worked on?</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.727" end="00:53:27.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The program&#39;s excellent.</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.427" end="00:53:28.427" style="s2">It&#39;ll get us that deal with the Knight</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.627" end="00:53:31.027" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.427" end="00:53:31.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Grey.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.776" end="00:53:36.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.227" end="00:53:42.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be frank.</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.527" end="00:53:44.227" style="s2">My time is valuable.</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.327" end="00:53:45.227" style="s2">I can only give you 15 minutes, Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.227" end="00:53:47.427" style="s2">Grey.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.227" end="00:53:49.227" style="s2">I hope you understand.</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.427" end="00:53:50.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Knight, I know everyone wants your</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.227" end="00:53:52.627" style="s2">family&#39;s investment and that keeps you</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.827" end="00:53:54.927" style="s2">busy.</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.627" end="00:53:57.127" style="s2">But 15 minutes?</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.927" end="00:53:59.827" style="s2">And who&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.127" end="00:53:59.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.127" end="00:54:04.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fairly familiar with Silicon</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.527" end="00:54:05.527" style="s2">Valley&#39;s elite.</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.127" end="00:54:06.427" style="s2">Which family is your wife from, Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.527" end="00:54:09.327" style="s2">Grey?</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.427" end="00:54:09.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t come from money.</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.927" end="00:54:17.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Knight,</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.027" end="00:54:20.427" style="s2">this is our company&#39;s latest system</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.627" end="00:54:23.427" style="s2">framework. Please, take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.427" end="00:54:23.427" style="s2">I&#39;d love to hear what you think.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.227" end="00:54:27.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frankly, I&#39;m not impressed.</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.527" end="00:54:36.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did this happen?</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.227" end="00:54:36.127" style="s2">The vulnerabilities I patched are back.</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.327" end="00:54:40.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Grey,</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.527" end="00:54:42.627" style="s2">you expect the Knight family to invest</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.427" end="00:54:45.427" style="s2">in a framework this shoddy?</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.627" end="00:54:45.427" style="s2">That&#39;s an insult.</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.727" end="00:54:50.027" style="s2">I see no reason to waste any more of</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.227" end="00:54:50.027" style="s2">each other&#39;s time.</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.527" end="00:54:53.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then how about working with me instead?</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.627" end="00:55:02.127" style="s2">You got into my computer when I went</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.927" end="00:55:04.727" style="s2">back to the office. You sabotaged my</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.127" end="00:55:04.727" style="s2">framework.</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.727" end="00:55:09.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just admit you&#39;re outmatched. I did you</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.828" end="00:55:11.528" style="s2">a favor.</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.128" end="00:55:14.528" style="s2">You got your first taste of failure</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.528" end="00:55:14.528" style="s2">a little sooner, that&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.828" end="00:55:18.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paige,</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.428" end="00:55:20.428" style="s2">you two know each other?</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.128" end="00:55:22.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s the one the Grays adopted.</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.428" end="00:55:24.428" style="s2">An ungrateful bastard who turned on the</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.228" end="00:55:26.528" style="s2">people who raised him.</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.428" end="00:55:28.128" style="s2">Your pitch is a bust.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.528" end="00:55:30.528" style="s2">So take your day laborer wife and get</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.128" end="00:55:33.628" style="s2">lost.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.528" end="00:55:35.028" style="s2">Let me catch up with my old friend.</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.628" end="00:55:37.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paige and I have known each other since</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.028" end="00:55:37.928" style="s2">she was studying abroad.</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.928" end="00:55:43.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s why the Grays were so sure of</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.428" end="00:55:43.528" style="s2">themselves yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.128" end="00:55:50.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Knight, you promised us 15 minutes</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.028" end="00:55:52.228" style="s2">if I remember correctly. Our time is up.</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.628" end="00:55:54.128" style="s2">I&#39;d like anyone who isn&#39;t part of this</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.228" end="00:55:55.828" style="s2">meeting to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.128" end="00:55:57.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve already lost. Why are you still</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.828" end="00:55:59.128" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.328" end="00:56:02.428" style="s2">What do you think you can do</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.128" end="00:56:02.428" style="s2">with a framework full of holes?</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.028" end="00:56:06.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as there&#39;s time left, we still</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.428" end="00:56:08.028" style="s2">have a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.028" end="00:56:10.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen, don&#39;t push your luck.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.028" end="00:56:11.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paige, I&#39;m still your brother. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.128" end="00:56:13.628" style="s2">Stay put and behave.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.728" end="00:56:16.228" style="s2">Raise your voice at me again</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.628" end="00:56:16.228" style="s2">and you&#39;ll regret [music] it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.828" end="00:56:22.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian,</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.128" end="00:56:25.528" style="s2">are you really going to waste your time</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.628" end="00:56:25.528" style="s2">on someone like him?</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.628" end="00:56:31.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Gray, even if I honor our 15-minute</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.628" end="00:56:32.628" style="s2">agreement, you&#39;ve only got 5 minutes</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.628" end="00:56:35.728" style="s2">left.</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.628" end="00:56:35.728" style="s2">What can you possibly do?</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.928" end="00:56:41.928" style="s2">You think you can give me a new proposal</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.128" end="00:56:41.928" style="s2">in 5 minutes?</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.728" end="00:56:53.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, please. You think a few keystrokes</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.128" end="00:56:54.728" style="s2">will magically give you a perfect</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.528" end="00:56:58.528" style="s2">framework?</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.728" end="00:56:58.528" style="s2">Mr. Knight, here&#39;s our revised proposal.</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.128" end="00:57:02.828" style="s2">Seriously, Galen?</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.928" end="00:57:05.128" style="s2">Who do you think you are?</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.828" end="00:57:06.928" style="s2">You think you can fix it that fast?</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.128" end="00:57:08.528" style="s2">Just because you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.928" end="00:57:09.928" style="s2">doesn&#39;t mean no one can.</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.528" end="00:57:12.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just checked it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.928" end="00:57:14.329" style="s2">The overall framework is still intact,</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.229" end="00:57:16.229" style="s2">but there are too many bugs.</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.329" end="00:57:18.929" style="s2">We can&#39;t possibly patch them all in the</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.229" end="00:57:18.929" style="s2">time we have.</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.629" end="00:57:22.729" style="s2">Mr. Gray, I don&#39;t see any point in</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.929" end="00:57:25.129" style="s2">wasting more time either.</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.729" end="00:57:27.029" style="s2">I&#39;d heard of you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.129" end="00:57:28.829" style="s2">I thought you were good at this.</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.029" end="00:57:30.129" style="s2">What a disappointment.</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.829" end="00:57:31.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Knight,</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.129" end="00:57:32.929" style="s2">we still have a minute left.</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.729" end="00:57:34.229" style="s2">You haven&#39;t even looked at our</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.929" end="00:57:36.929" style="s2">framework,</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.229" end="00:57:38.429" style="s2">and you&#39;ve already made up your mind.</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.929" end="00:57:39.829" style="s2">Seems the Knight family is just as</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.429" end="00:57:41.629" style="s2">disappoint</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.829" end="00:57:43.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you just say, you worthless</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.629" end="00:57:44.529" style="s2">hired help?</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.029" end="00:57:46.529" style="s2">I thought Mr. Knight could be a valuable</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.529" end="00:57:49.729" style="s2">business partner, but you&#39;ve been a real</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.529" end="00:57:49.729" style="s2">disappointment, Mr. Knight.</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.529" end="00:57:53.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.629" end="00:57:55.129" style="s2">One last chance.</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.729" end="00:57:57.429" style="s2">Then you&#39;ll have no excuses when you</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.129" end="00:57:57.429" style="s2">lose.</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.229" end="00:58:01.929" style="s2">The framework is flawless this time.</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.529" end="00:58:03.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.929" end="00:58:04.729" style="s2">That framework must have been thrown</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.029" end="00:58:06.729" style="s2">together overnight. How could you</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.729" end="00:58:07.929" style="s2">possibly fix that many bugs?</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.729" end="00:58:09.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She still remembered a lot of the</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.929" end="00:58:11.929" style="s2">details.</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.529" end="00:58:13.429" style="s2">She just had to rewrite the fixes.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.929" end="00:58:15.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who do you think you&#39;re fooling?</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.429" end="00:58:16.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But she was also a top student at MIT.</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.629" end="00:58:19.429" style="s2">You&#39;re in no position to judge her</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.829" end="00:58:19.429" style="s2">abilities.</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.029" end="00:58:22.829" style="s2">You&#39;ve corrected every flaw</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.829" end="00:58:24.129" style="s2">and filled in everything that was</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.829" end="00:58:25.829" style="s2">missing.</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.129" end="00:58:27.429" style="s2">You&#39;re better than I expected.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.829" end="00:58:29.029" style="s2">Your revised proposal is definitely</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.429" end="00:58:30.529" style="s2">stronger than Paige&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.029" end="00:58:32.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, Mr. Knight,</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.529" end="00:58:34.629" style="s2">have I earned the right to continue this</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.029" end="00:58:34.629" style="s2">discussion?</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.429" end="00:58:39.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.829" end="00:58:42.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.529" end="00:58:44.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You and Paige both work for Gray Tech.</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.129" end="00:58:45.905" style="s2">Whichever one of you gets the credit,</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.329" end="00:58:47.229" style="s2">my money still goes to Gray Tech.</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.905" end="00:58:48.329" style="s2">[music] As long as the company makes</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.229" end="00:58:50.829" style="s2">money,</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.329" end="00:58:50.829" style="s2">so do I.</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.529" end="00:58:57.029" style="s2">Your proposal was good,</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.729" end="00:58:58.429" style="s2">so I gave it another look.</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.029" end="00:59:00.529" style="s2">That doesn&#39;t mean I&#39;d throw away years</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.429" end="00:59:03.929" style="s2">of friendship with Paige.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.529" end="00:59:03.929" style="s2">That&#39;s why she&#39;s getting my investment.</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.529" end="00:59:07.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you not listening, Galen?</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.529" end="00:59:09.229" style="s2">Julian and I have been friends for</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.829" end="00:59:11.429" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.229" end="00:59:13.731" style="s2">Did you really think one proposal would</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.429" end="00:59:15.731" style="s2">be enough to beat me?</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.731" end="00:59:16.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s why you&#39;re turning me down,</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.731" end="00:59:17.831" style="s2">Mr. Knight?</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.831" end="00:59:19.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.831" end="00:59:21.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lost, Galen. Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.931" end="00:59:22.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.431" end="00:59:24.131" style="s2">Looks like we won&#39;t be working together</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.631" end="00:59:25.431" style="s2">this time.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.131" end="00:59:27.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you never intended to work with me,</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.431" end="00:59:29.231" style="s2">Mr. Knight, why waste our time?</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.331" end="00:59:31.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you were from another company, I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.231" end="00:59:32.531" style="s2">consider your proposal.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.031" end="00:59:35.031" style="s2">Unfortunately</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.531" end="00:59:37.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save it. I can accept being beaten by</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.031" end="00:59:39.231" style="s2">someone better, but I won&#39;t let anyone</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.231" end="00:59:42.431" style="s2">play me for a fool. You&#39;re going to</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.231" end="00:59:44.931" style="s2">answer for everything you did today.</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.431" end="00:59:44.931" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.331" end="01:00:03.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this about? Mr. Knight?</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.031" end="01:00:06.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a great deal of respect</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.931" end="01:00:08.731" style="s2">for your abilities, Mr. Gray.</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.431" end="01:00:12.331" style="s2">That&#39;s why I agreed to this meeting,</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.731" end="01:00:13.331" style="s2">but my patience has limits into my face.</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.331" end="01:00:16.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re used to throwing your weight</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.331" end="01:00:17.431" style="s2">around at the office. Make it nice and</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.131" end="01:00:20.031" style="s2">loud.</p>
<p begin="01:00:17.431" end="01:00:21.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like that idea.</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.031" end="01:00:22.731" style="s2">Just because Julian and I aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.431" end="01:00:24.831" style="s2">friends,</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.731" end="01:00:26.231" style="s2">you think you can treat us like this?</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.831" end="01:00:28.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.231" end="01:00:29.431" style="s2">Call in a favor of your own</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.431" end="01:00:31.431" style="s2">if you can.</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.431" end="01:00:32.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We won&#39;t be doing business</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.431" end="01:00:34.931" style="s2">ever.</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.931" end="01:00:37.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This country has laws. You can&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.931" end="01:00:37.931" style="s2">whatever you want. Laws are for people</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.031" end="01:00:39.731" style="s2">like you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.931" end="01:00:41.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Constitution guarantees equal</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.731" end="01:00:45.731" style="s2">treatment under the law. Even the</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.631" end="01:00:45.731" style="s2">richest families aren&#39;t above it.</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.331" end="01:00:53.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.631" end="01:01:01.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.931" end="01:01:03.031" style="s2">I thought that bracelet looked familiar.</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.431" end="01:01:04.431" style="s2">It really is the Sterling family star</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.031" end="01:01:06.031" style="s2">bracelet.</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.431" end="01:01:08.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Sterlings?</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.031" end="01:01:10.331" style="s2">The most powerful family in the world?</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.331" end="01:01:11.431" style="s2">The dynasty that&#39;s been around for 100</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.331" end="01:01:14.831" style="s2">years?</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.431" end="01:01:16.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Their businesses span the globe.</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.831" end="01:01:19.032" style="s2">Their influence reaches everyone. Keep</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.132" end="01:01:20.432" style="s2">the Sterlings happy these days.</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.032" end="01:01:23.632" style="s2">How do you know</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.432" end="01:01:23.632" style="s2">someone in the Sterling family?</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.232" end="01:01:30.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve never heard of the Sterling family.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.432" end="01:01:32.332" style="s2">My mentor at MIT gave me this bracelet</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.332" end="01:01:34.332" style="s2">as a graduation gift.</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.332" end="01:01:36.932" style="s2">Maybe he&#39;s mistaken. Julian, you must be</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.332" end="01:01:40.832" style="s2">mistaken. Day labor on construction</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.932" end="01:01:40.832" style="s2">sites. Anyone in the Sterling family.</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.332" end="01:01:44.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you blind?</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.632" end="01:01:46.632" style="s2">I know a Sterling family treasure when I</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.132" end="01:01:46.632" style="s2">see one.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.732" end="01:01:50.432" style="s2">I&#39;m calling the head of the family right</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.532" end="01:01:52.932" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.432" end="01:01:55.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Layla married a thief.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.932" end="01:01:57.532" style="s2">You won&#39;t just be finished at Gray Tech.</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.332" end="01:02:00.932" style="s2">You&#39;ll be finished in this city.</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.532" end="01:02:03.832" style="s2">I didn&#39;t steal anything. I swear.</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.932" end="01:02:03.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I believe you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.132" end="01:02:08.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re interrupting me. This had better</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.932" end="01:02:10.432" style="s2">be important.</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.332" end="01:02:12.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My apologies, Mrs. Sterling.</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.432" end="01:02:14.032" style="s2">I&#39;ve just discovered that someone has</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.432" end="01:02:14.932" style="s2">stolen a treasure belonging to your</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.032" end="01:02:16.732" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.932" end="01:02:18.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who would dare steal from the Sterling</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.732" end="01:02:19.932" style="s2">family?</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.132" end="01:02:21.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve detained the thief.</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.932" end="01:02:24.632" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave it to you to decide what</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.832" end="01:02:24.632" style="s2">happens next.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.232" end="01:02:31.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put them on the phone. Hello?</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.432" end="01:02:32.932" style="s2">I swear I didn&#39;t steal the bracelet.</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.832" end="01:02:34.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Layla?</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.932" end="01:02:35.432" style="s2">Is that you?</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.332" end="01:02:37.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anastasia?</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.432" end="01:02:39.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat.</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.332" end="01:02:42.632" style="s2">Did you forget about me?</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.332" end="01:02:45.732" style="s2">All these years and not one phone call?</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.632" end="01:02:45.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t want to bother you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.232" end="01:02:51.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back when I was doing my PhD at MIT, I</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.432" end="01:02:53.432" style="s2">saw more potential in you than in any</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.332" end="01:02:55.532" style="s2">other younger student.</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.432" end="01:02:57.532" style="s2">You never have to be so formal with me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.532" end="01:03:00.432" style="s2">I didn&#39;t steal the bracelet</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.532" end="01:03:00.432" style="s2">that you gave it to me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.932" end="01:03:06.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put Julian on the phone.</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.132" end="01:03:11.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Sterling, this is Julian Knight.</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.332" end="01:03:12.632" style="s2">There seems to have been a</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.232" end="01:03:14.432" style="s2">misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.632" end="01:03:17.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since when did the Knight family have</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.432" end="01:03:20.033" style="s2">the nerve to slander someone I mentored?</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.532" end="01:03:22.233" style="s2">I gave Layla that bracelet myself before</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.033" end="01:03:24.533" style="s2">I went home after graduation.</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.233" end="01:03:26.633" style="s2">If your family doesn&#39;t believe me, I can</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.533" end="01:03:29.133" style="s2">fly back right now and tell you in</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.633" end="01:03:29.133" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.633" end="01:03:33.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a misunderstanding. That&#39;s all it</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.233" end="01:03:35.833" style="s2">is. There&#39;s no need for the head of the</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.633" end="01:03:37.233" style="s2">Sterling family to trouble herself over</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.833" end="01:03:39.433" style="s2">something so minor.</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.233" end="01:03:41.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As my mentor,</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.433" end="01:03:43.933" style="s2">I honestly had no idea what family she</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.233" end="01:03:47.533" style="s2">came from. How did she get that lucky?</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.933" end="01:03:47.533" style="s2">God, I wish I had her connection.</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.133" end="01:03:52.733" style="s2">Apologize and slap myself?</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.933" end="01:03:55.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not.</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.733" end="01:03:55.033" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.933" end="01:03:59.233" style="s2">What do you want?</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.833" end="01:04:00.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since Lila knows the head of the</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.233" end="01:04:02.933" style="s2">Sterling family,</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.833" end="01:04:04.233" style="s2">there&#39;s no reason for me to invest with</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.933" end="01:04:05.833" style="s2">anyone else.</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.233" end="01:04:07.533" style="s2">Mr. Gray,</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.833" end="01:04:09.433" style="s2">I look forward to working with you.</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.533" end="01:04:10.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, you can&#39;t do this. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.433" end="01:04:12.033" style="s2">friends.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.633" end="01:04:13.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s all we are,</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.033" end="01:04:15.133" style="s2">friends.</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.233" end="01:04:18.633" style="s2">You can&#39;t possibly compete with a</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.133" end="01:04:18.633" style="s2">connection to the Sterling family.</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.533" end="01:04:27.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Gray, there&#39;s an urgent matter at</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.033" end="01:04:29.433" style="s2">the office.</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.133" end="01:04:30.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lila, you were up working all night. Let</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.433" end="01:04:31.333" style="s2">me take you back to the yacht so you can</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.733" end="01:04:33.233" style="s2">rest.</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.333" end="01:04:35.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Work comes first. I&#39;ll take the bus</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.233" end="01:04:35.533" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.333" end="01:04:41.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you headed?</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.833" end="01:04:42.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t trouble yourself, Mr. Knight.</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.633" end="01:04:45.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me give you a ride.</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.733" end="01:04:45.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.733" end="01:04:52.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, don&#39;t tell me you&#39;re interested</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.333" end="01:04:53.933" style="s2">in her. How about I help you steal her</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.333" end="01:04:56.333" style="s2">away?</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.933" end="01:04:58.833" style="s2">All you have to do is promise me one</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.333" end="01:04:59.733" style="s2">thing. Pull your investment in Galen.</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.833" end="01:05:02.033" style="s2">Deal?</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.733" end="01:05:02.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.733" end="01:05:06.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello?</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.433" end="01:05:09.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Julian.</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.633" end="01:05:11.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Knight? How did you get my number?</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.233" end="01:05:12.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a phone number. It wasn&#39;t hard. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.233" end="01:05:14.733" style="s2">calling because I have some concerns</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.733" end="01:05:17.133" style="s2">about the proposal you gave me. We need</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.733" end="01:05:18.533" style="s2">to discuss them in person.</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.133" end="01:05:19.633" style="s2">I&#39;ll send you the hotel&#39;s address and my</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.533" end="01:05:20.935" style="s2">room number.</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.633" end="01:05:23.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A hotel?</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.935" end="01:05:24.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Knight, my husband isn&#39;t home yet.</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.035" end="01:05:24.735" style="s2">Why don&#39;t I wait for him and then we can</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.535" end="01:05:26.835" style="s2">both</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.735" end="01:05:29.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My patience has limit. Pass this up and</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.835" end="01:05:30.935" style="s2">you won&#39;t get another chance.</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.435" end="01:05:33.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.935" end="01:05:36.635" style="s2">But if you don&#39;t land the deal,</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.135" end="01:05:36.635" style="s2">you hand over every share you own.</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.535" end="01:05:43.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s taking the bait, Ms. Grey.</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.535" end="01:05:51.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.435" end="01:05:53.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Knight, you said there was a problem</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.635" end="01:05:55.335" style="s2">with the proposal.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.235" end="01:05:57.535" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.335" end="01:06:00.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really want to discuss business</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.535" end="01:06:00.435" style="s2">with the door open?</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.535" end="01:06:06.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just a glass of wine, Layla.</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.835" end="01:06:08.535" style="s2">Don&#39;t leave me drinking alone.</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.935" end="01:06:10.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll pass on the wine.</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.535" end="01:06:13.335" style="s2">Let&#39;s get down to business.</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.135" end="01:06:17.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To you. I&#39;ll go first.</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.335" end="01:06:18.435" style="s2">You&#39;re here now. Sit down. Let&#39;s talk.</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.235" end="01:06:20.235" style="s2">Actually, there&#39;s nothing wrong with</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.435" end="01:06:23.235" style="s2">your proposal.</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.235" end="01:06:25.935" style="s2">I wanted some time alone with you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.235" end="01:06:27.935" style="s2">You&#39;re a fascinating woman, Layla.</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.935" end="01:06:30.635" style="s2">You&#39;re wasted on Galen.</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.935" end="01:06:33.135" style="s2">Husbands can be replaced.</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.635" end="01:06:34.835" style="s2">The Knight family can give you things.</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.135" end="01:06:36.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen, you landed the Knight family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.835" end="01:06:37.235" style="s2">investment.</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.135" end="01:06:39.335" style="s2">Let&#39;s go out for a nice dinner and</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.235" end="01:06:42.235" style="s2">celebrate.</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.335" end="01:06:45.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Layla&#39;s resting at home.</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.235" end="01:06:45.335" style="s2">I going back to be with her.</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.035" end="01:06:51.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen, you&#39;re still thinking about that</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.835" end="01:06:53.735" style="s2">wife of yours?</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.835" end="01:06:56.135" style="s2">The Knight family has already agreed to</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.735" end="01:06:57.235" style="s2">invest in me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.135" end="01:06:58.635" style="s2">I have something to show you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.235" end="01:07:01.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In a hotel room</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.635" end="01:07:01.535" style="s2">with another man?</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.135" end="01:07:09.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it true the wife of Grey Tech&#39;s CEO</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.335" end="01:07:12.635" style="s2">worked menial jobs before, marrying her</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.935" end="01:07:12.635" style="s2">way to the top?</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.935" end="01:07:16.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We also hear she&#39;s in there.</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.235" end="01:07:18.635" style="s2">Mr. Grey,</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.735" end="01:07:21.135" style="s2">are you here to ask for a divorce?</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.635" end="01:07:24.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop making things up.</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.135" end="01:07:24.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can be sued for spreading lies.</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.536" end="01:07:30.036" style="s2">You&#39;re a gray, too.</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.636" end="01:07:31.936" style="s2">What do you gain?</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.036" end="01:07:33.536" style="s2">You really have no shame. Layla isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.936" end="01:07:34.836" style="s2">that kind of person.</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.536" end="01:07:37.536" style="s2">I trust her.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.836" end="01:07:39.036" style="s2">Gail, don&#39;t open it. The press is right</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.536" end="01:07:41.936" style="s2">here. What if</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.036" end="01:07:41.936" style="s2">I choose to trust her.</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.836" end="01:07:48.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen,</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.036" end="01:07:50.436" style="s2">what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.836" end="01:07:51.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a disgusting stunt to pull, Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.436" end="01:07:53.136" style="s2">Knight.</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.936" end="01:07:54.136" style="s2">I have no idea what you&#39;re talking</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.136" end="01:07:55.336" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.136" end="01:07:57.836" style="s2">Layla and I were just discussing her</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.336" end="01:07:57.836" style="s2">proposal.</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.136" end="01:08:02.036" style="s2">You&#39;re not drunk.</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.636" end="01:08:03.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.036" end="01:08:04.636" style="s2">Something felt wrong the second I got to</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.736" end="01:08:06.036" style="s2">the</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.636" end="01:08:09.136" style="s2">In a place like that,</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.036" end="01:08:09.136" style="s2">after he drugged the wine.</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.236" end="01:08:22.836" style="s2">It didn&#39;t work. He took her away.</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.136" end="01:08:23.736" style="s2">Galen, all of a sudden I feel so hot.</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.836" end="01:08:25.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Layla,</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.736" end="01:08:28.236" style="s2">Layla, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.836" end="01:08:30.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The press is already all over this.</p>
<p begin="01:08:28.236" end="01:08:32.336" style="s2">If anything else happens, it could</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.036" end="01:08:34.236" style="s2">damage Gray Tech&#39;s reputation.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.336" end="01:08:36.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re worried about the company</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.236" end="01:08:36.536" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.032" end="01:08:41.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.636" end="01:08:41.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.236" end="01:08:44.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just getting you a cold towel.</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.436" end="01:08:46.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have feelings for me?</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.136" end="01:08:48.336" style="s2">Then will you help me?</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.636" end="01:08:49.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not thinking clearly.</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.336" end="01:08:51.836" style="s2">I can&#39;t take advantage of you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.836" end="01:08:54.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am thinking clearly.</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.836" end="01:08:55.536" style="s2">I know you&#39;re Galen. You&#39;re my husband,</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.336" end="01:08:58.836" style="s2">my man,</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.536" end="01:08:58.836" style="s2">the one I&#39;m going to grow old with.</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.836" end="01:09:04.836" style="s2">You&#39;re telling me Galen got the Knight</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.136" end="01:09:07.936" style="s2">family&#39;s investment?</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.836" end="01:09:07.936" style="s2">You worthless little brat.</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.036" end="01:09:10.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you taking it out on our</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.936" end="01:09:12.136" style="s2">daughter?</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.436" end="01:09:14.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She couldn&#39;t even beat some girl who</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.136" end="01:09:16.836" style="s2">works odd jobs. She deserves it. I&#39;LL</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.936" end="01:09:19.236" style="s2">BEAT HER TO DEATH.</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.836" end="01:09:21.236" style="s2">Do you have any idea how many strings</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.236" end="01:09:22.536" style="s2">I&#39;ll have to pull to get out of that</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.236" end="01:09:23.228" style="s2">bed?</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.536" end="01:09:24.336" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.228" end="01:09:25.836" style="s2">[screaming] help me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:24.336" end="01:09:27.236" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.836" end="01:09:27.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s done.</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.236" end="01:09:29.338" style="s2">Beating</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.438" end="01:09:31.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to death won&#39;t change anything.</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.338" end="01:09:33.938" style="s2">Don&#39;t forget Paige is the only daughter</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.338" end="01:09:33.938" style="s2">you have.</p>
<p begin="01:09:34.338" end="01:09:37.237" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I had another daughter,</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.938" end="01:09:39.737" style="s2">an older one.</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.237" end="01:09:42.338" style="s2">I promised my mother on her deathbed</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.737" end="01:09:44.538" style="s2">that I&#39;d take care of my daughter,</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.338" end="01:09:46.637" style="s2">but I lost her.</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.538" end="01:09:49.438" style="s2">She must be all grown up now.</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.637" end="01:09:51.137" style="s2">Maybe she has a family, a career.</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.438" end="01:09:54.137" style="s2">I was so careless.</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.137" end="01:09:56.738" style="s2">It was all my fault. My baby, I&#39;ve never</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.137" end="01:09:59.738" style="s2">stopped looking for you. Where are you?</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.738" end="01:09:59.738" style="s2">Where&#39;s my little girl?</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.637" end="01:10:05.338" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.838" end="01:10:08.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.338" end="01:10:08.538" style="s2">You found my daughter?</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.938" end="01:10:14.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As far as I&#39;m concerned,</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.938" end="01:10:15.838" style="s2">you&#39;re still nowhere near X&#39;s league.</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.137" end="01:10:17.538" style="s2">But what can I do? My brother&#39;s in love</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.838" end="01:10:18.738" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.538" end="01:10:20.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s fair.</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.738" end="01:10:21.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t get too comfortable, though.</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.137" end="01:10:23.538" style="s2">You&#39;re just a stand-in.</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.538" end="01:10:25.738" style="s2">Once I meet X, I&#39;ll make sure she&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="01:10:23.538" end="01:10:27.438" style="s2">one my brother marries.</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.738" end="01:10:29.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, X</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.438" end="01:10:30.938" style="s2">might not be as perfect as you think.</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.538" end="01:10:32.738" style="s2">Maybe she&#39;s worked construction jobs,</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.938" end="01:10:33.838" style="s2">too. Maybe she&#39;s even fallen for the</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.738" end="01:10:35.238" style="s2">wrong person.</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.838" end="01:10:38.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m warning you,</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.238" end="01:10:39.938" style="s2">don&#39;t insult my idol or you&#39;ll be sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.838" end="01:10:41.174" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.938" end="01:10:43.137" style="s2">Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.174" end="01:10:44.938" style="s2">[sighs] I never thought I&#39;d actually get</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.137" end="01:10:46.738" style="s2">to meet my family someday.</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.938" end="01:10:48.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean you found your birth parents?</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.738" end="01:10:50.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister Margaret at the Children&#39;s Home</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.038" end="01:10:51.538" style="s2">says we still need a DNA test,</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.538" end="01:10:53.438" style="s2">so I have to go over there this</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.538" end="01:10:54.738" style="s2">afternoon.</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.438" end="01:10:56.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll come with you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.738" end="01:10:57.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t. We&#39;ve got a board meeting</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.137" end="01:10:58.137" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.238" end="01:10:59.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.137" end="01:11:00.538" style="s2">It&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.137" end="01:11:03.338" style="s2">Take care of work.</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.538" end="01:11:03.338" style="s2">I can go on my own.</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.637" end="01:11:08.137" style="s2">Why do you turn up everywhere I go?</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.938" end="01:11:09.238" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing but bad luck.</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.137" end="01:11:10.838" style="s2">Still trying to worm your way into the</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.238" end="01:11:12.137" style="s2">Gray family?</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.838" end="01:11:14.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re finally being reunited with our</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.137" end="01:11:17.238" style="s2">daughter today, and you have to show up</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.338" end="01:11:19.338" style="s2">and ruin it. Get the hell out.</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.238" end="01:11:20.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister Margaret asked me to come today.</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.338" end="01:11:23.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have no right to make me leave.</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.938" end="01:11:25.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Layla, what are you wearing?</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.137" end="01:11:26.438" style="s2">It all looks so cheap.</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.038" end="01:11:28.137" style="s2">I heard you&#39;ve been picking up shifts on</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.438" end="01:11:30.139" style="s2">construction sites.</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.137" end="01:11:32.339" style="s2">Beg nicely, and maybe I&#39;ll take pity on</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.139" end="01:11:34.539" style="s2">you and find you a job sweeping streets.</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.339" end="01:11:35.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Oh, right.</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.539" end="01:11:37.239" style="s2">I think Sister Margaret said the home</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.739" end="01:11:39.139" style="s2">needs renovating.</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.239" end="01:11:40.539" style="s2">If you&#39;ve got money to spare,</p>
<p begin="01:11:39.139" end="01:11:42.439" style="s2">why don&#39;t you pay for it?</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.539" end="01:11:43.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the home needs renovating, of course</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.439" end="01:11:45.239" style="s2">I want to help. I don&#39;t have the money</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.739" end="01:11:47.339" style="s2">right now, but I can have someone send</p>
<p begin="01:11:45.239" end="01:11:47.339" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.839" end="01:11:52.439" style="s2">Um, I just found out the children&#39;s home</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.839" end="01:11:54.639" style="s2">needs renovations.</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.439" end="01:11:56.239" style="s2">Could you lend me some money?</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.639" end="01:11:57.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lend you money?</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.239" end="01:12:00.039" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.739" end="01:12:01.739" style="s2">Lila, I&#39;m your husband.</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.039" end="01:12:03.739" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you the money. I&#39;m not lending</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.739" end="01:12:05.539" style="s2">it to you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.739" end="01:12:07.439" style="s2">Do you understand what I&#39;m saying?</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.539" end="01:12:08.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Message received, hubby.</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.439" end="01:12:10.039" style="s2">I promise I won&#39;t make that mistake</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.739" end="01:12:11.539" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.039" end="01:12:12.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lila,</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.539" end="01:12:15.939" style="s2">thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.739" end="01:12:18.539" style="s2">Thank you so much. We just received $20</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.939" end="01:12:21.039" style="s2">million in your name to renovate the</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.539" end="01:12:21.039" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.739" end="01:12:25.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $20 million?</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.739" end="01:12:27.239" style="s2">I&#39;ve never seen that kind of money in my</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.339" end="01:12:28.539" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="01:12:27.239" end="01:12:30.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But Lila just does odd jobs on</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.539" end="01:12:31.739" style="s2">construction sites.</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.039" end="01:12:35.739" style="s2">Where would she get that kind of money?</p>
<p begin="01:12:31.739" end="01:12:36.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look how far you&#39;ve come. I had no idea.</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.739" end="01:12:39.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it weren&#39;t for you in this home,</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.839" end="01:12:41.539" style="s2">Sister, I might not even be alive today.</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.839" end="01:12:43.539" style="s2">I want this place to be able to help</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.539" end="01:12:45.439" style="s2">more children who need it.</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.539" end="01:12:46.839" style="s2">Every kid out there on the streets</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.439" end="01:12:49.739" style="s2">deserves a home.</p>
<p begin="01:12:46.839" end="01:12:51.739" style="s2">Of course. Of course. The test results</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.739" end="01:12:53.739" style="s2">should be here soon. Just wait here a</p>
<p begin="01:12:51.739" end="01:12:56.139" style="s2">little longer.</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.739" end="01:12:57.939" style="s2">Hey Lila, what&#39;s your secret? How did</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.139" end="01:12:59.439" style="s2">you get all that money?</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.939" end="01:13:01.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously, Lila,</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.439" end="01:13:03.339" style="s2">we all grew up here together.</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.339" end="01:13:05.539" style="s2">If you know how to get rich, you&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.339" end="01:13:07.139" style="s2">to let us in on it.</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.539" end="01:13:11.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, I</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.139" end="01:13:11.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lila gets her money by living off a man.</p>
<p begin="01:13:11.939" end="01:13:15.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do you look so scared?</p>
<p begin="01:13:13.739" end="01:13:16.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a special day for the Gray</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.039" end="01:13:18.339" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.239" end="01:13:19.339" style="s2">We&#39;re reuniting with our daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.339" end="01:13:21.139" style="s2">Why are you hanging around where you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.339" end="01:13:23.839" style="s2">not wanted?</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.139" end="01:13:25.939" style="s2">Hoping to claim some connection to us?</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.839" end="01:13:28.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sick of looking at you. Get out.</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.939" end="01:13:31.340" style="s2">Sister Margaret asked me to come.</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.039" end="01:13:31.340" style="s2">You have no right to me out.</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.140" end="01:13:40.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.940" end="01:13:42.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I finally found you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.940" end="01:13:46.940" style="s2">Lila is the child I lost all those years</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.940" end="01:13:46.940" style="s2">ago. My own daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.440" end="01:13:51.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re really my mom? It&#39;s all my fault.</p>
<p begin="01:13:49.540" end="01:13:52.540" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t careful enough and I lost you,</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.440" end="01:13:53.840" style="s2">but I&#39;ve been searching for you all</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.540" end="01:13:55.340" style="s2">these years.</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.840" end="01:13:57.840" style="s2">And you were right here, right in front</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.340" end="01:13:59.540" style="s2">of me. This is all my fault. The way I</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.840" end="01:14:00.540" style="s2">treated you. How could I be so cruel?</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.540" end="01:14:01.940" style="s2">How could I</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.540" end="01:14:04.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on here?</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.940" end="01:14:06.840" style="s2">Paige, I warned you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.540" end="01:14:08.340" style="s2">If you ever hurt my wife again,</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.840" end="01:14:11.240" style="s2">you&#39;ll answer to me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.340" end="01:14:13.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t me. Stop making things up.</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.240" end="01:14:16.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the one who slapped her. I won&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.340" end="01:14:16.440" style="s2">anyone hurt my daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.040" end="01:14:22.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ever since I was little, you&#39;ve had this</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.040" end="01:14:23.221" style="s2">fantasy that I&#39;d marry your missing</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.040" end="01:14:25.440" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.221" end="01:14:27.340" style="s2">[snorts] I kept refusing, so you started</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.440" end="01:14:29.240" style="s2">setting me up on dates and arranging</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.340" end="01:14:31.740" style="s2">matches, trying to get me to agree to</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.240" end="01:14:33.840" style="s2">marry her.</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.740" end="01:14:36.840" style="s2">You spent years trying to control me, to</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.840" end="01:14:39.140" style="s2">keep me on a leash. But I&#39;m married now.</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.840" end="01:14:41.540" style="s2">Whether you found your daughter or not,</p>
<p begin="01:14:39.140" end="01:14:43.540" style="s2">I&#39;m not marrying her.</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.540" end="01:14:47.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, you might not want to</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.540" end="01:14:47.040" style="s2">rule it out quite so firmly.</p>
<p begin="01:14:47.140" end="01:14:52.040" style="s2">Apparently,</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.140" end="01:14:52.940" style="s2">I&#39;m the Gray family&#39;s missing daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.040" end="01:14:53.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re actually?</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.940" end="01:14:55.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So,</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.840" end="01:14:56.740" style="s2">do you still want</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.340" end="01:14:59.040" style="s2">to be married to me?</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.740" end="01:15:00.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t even say that.</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.040" end="01:15:02.840" style="s2">You went missing before Dorothy adopted</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.540" end="01:15:04.340" style="s2">me. We&#39;re not related by blood. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.840" end="01:15:05.840" style="s2">my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.340" end="01:15:08.140" style="s2">And that&#39;s not changing.</p>
<p begin="01:15:05.840" end="01:15:09.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lila, I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.140" end="01:15:11.040" style="s2">Could you</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.140" end="01:15:13.740" style="s2">come stay at the estate</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.040" end="01:15:16.340" style="s2">for a few days?</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.740" end="01:15:17.840" style="s2">Glenn, that house was left to you</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.340" end="01:15:20.140" style="s2">by your parents.</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.840" end="01:15:22.240" style="s2">Now that my daughter&#39;s back, the two of</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.140" end="01:15:23.340" style="s2">you should move back in.</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.240" end="01:15:24.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.340" end="01:15:26.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m calling a shareholders&#39; meeting</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.640" end="01:15:29.240" style="s2">tomorrow. I have something important to</p>
<p begin="01:15:26.540" end="01:15:31.540" style="s2">announce. Both of you, make sure you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.240" end="01:15:31.540" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.617" end="01:15:37.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.940" end="01:15:39.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can believe Layla is the child who</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.442" end="01:15:41.642" style="s2">went missing. What do we do now? She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.842" end="01:15:42.842" style="s2">your mother&#39;s daughter, too.</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.642" end="01:15:45.642" style="s2">What if she tries to take your mother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.842" end="01:15:45.642" style="s2">shares from you?</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.142" end="01:15:52.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, isn&#39;t this my lucky day? Layla,</p>
<p begin="01:15:48.942" end="01:15:52.942" style="s2">mom&#39;s shares are mine. All mine.</p>
<p begin="01:15:53.342" end="01:15:56.542" style="s2">Paige is petty, and she never lets</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.042" end="01:15:57.742" style="s2">anything go.</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.542" end="01:15:59.242" style="s2">She&#39;s definitely going to come after</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.742" end="01:16:01.142" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.242" end="01:16:02.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t let you lose to her.</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.142" end="01:16:05.142" style="s2">Whatever anyone says, you&#39;re the one I</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.842" end="01:16:05.142" style="s2">want.</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.842" end="01:16:12.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Galen, Layla, you two?</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.642" end="01:16:13.442" style="s2">Oh my god, I I didn&#39;t see anything.</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.142" end="01:16:14.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nate,</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.442" end="01:16:18.942" style="s2">what did you need?</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.742" end="01:16:18.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh I forgot. Don&#39;t let me interrupt.</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.642" end="01:16:31.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve asked you all here because I have</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.842" end="01:16:33.942" style="s2">an important announcement.</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.942" end="01:16:36.342" style="s2">A DNA test has confirmed that Layla</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.942" end="01:16:39.742" style="s2">Anderson is the daughter my ex-husband</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.342" end="01:16:41.642" style="s2">and I lost all those years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.742" end="01:16:43.442" style="s2">She&#39;s a Grey by blood,</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.642" end="01:16:45.142" style="s2">and she&#39;ll also be a shareholder in Grey</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.442" end="01:16:47.542" style="s2">Tech.</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.142" end="01:16:49.042" style="s2">Be quiet.</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.542" end="01:16:50.942" style="s2">Your father&#39;s ex-wife worked at the</p>
<p begin="01:16:49.042" end="01:16:52.242" style="s2">hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.942" end="01:16:55.242" style="s2">While I was still weak from giving</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.242" end="01:16:57.162" style="s2">birth, she threw Layla in a dumpster,</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.242" end="01:16:58.942" style="s2">then brought you in to take her place. I</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.162" end="01:16:59.942" style="s2">[music] know exactly what happened.</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.942" end="01:17:01.742" style="s2">Layla,</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.942" end="01:17:04.242" style="s2">I&#39;d like to throw a party.</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.742" end="01:17:05.842" style="s2">I want all of San Francisco</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.242" end="01:17:07.142" style="s2">to know you&#39;re a Grey.</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.842" end="01:17:09.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those welcome parties are for little</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.142" end="01:17:11.142" style="s2">children.</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.542" end="01:17:12.442" style="s2">Layla&#39;s a grown woman.</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.142" end="01:17:13.542" style="s2">What&#39;s the point of throwing her one</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.442" end="01:17:15.642" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.542" end="01:17:17.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If everyone finds out, she&#39;ll make us</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.642" end="01:17:19.742" style="s2">all look bad.</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.342" end="01:17:21.642" style="s2">Everyone, I have an even more important</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.742" end="01:17:24.542" style="s2">announcement.</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.642" end="01:17:26.242" style="s2">I&#39;m transferring every share I own</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.542" end="01:17:28.742" style="s2">in the company</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.242" end="01:17:28.742" style="s2">to Layla.</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.842" end="01:17:37.243" style="s2">Only Galen has more.</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.342" end="01:17:40.143" style="s2">And you&#39;re giving it all to some</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.243" end="01:17:42.943" style="s2">stranger you just found?</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.143" end="01:17:44.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s not a stranger.</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.943" end="01:17:48.043" style="s2">She&#39;s my daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:17:44.543" end="01:17:50.543" style="s2">And I owe her more than 20 years of love</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.043" end="01:17:52.043" style="s2">and care. Not my biological daughter at</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.543" end="01:17:53.343" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.043" end="01:17:54.943" style="s2">You&#39;re Lawrence&#39;s daughter with his</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.343" end="01:17:56.443" style="s2">ex-wife.</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.943" end="01:17:57.543" style="s2">All these years.</p>
<p begin="01:17:56.443" end="01:17:59.843" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.543" end="01:18:01.543" style="s2">that&#39;s not true, is it?</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.843" end="01:18:02.843" style="s2">Say something.</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.543" end="01:18:04.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dorothy, how could you say that?</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.843" end="01:18:07.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Has it been so long you&#39;ve forgotten how</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.743" end="01:18:09.943" style="s2">this all started?</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.443" end="01:18:11.643" style="s2">When you married into the Gray family,</p>
<p begin="01:18:09.943" end="01:18:13.343" style="s2">you brought your daughter</p>
<p begin="01:18:11.643" end="01:18:15.643" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.343" end="01:18:18.343" style="s2">My own daughter was missing, so I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.643" end="01:18:18.343" style="s2">object.</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.543" end="01:18:24.943" style="s2">All these years you&#39;ve used my money to</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.143" end="01:18:27.143" style="s2">raise someone else&#39;s child.</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.943" end="01:18:29.343" style="s2">I let it go.</p>
<p begin="01:18:27.143" end="01:18:31.743" style="s2">But now my daughter is back and you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:18:29.343" end="01:18:33.943" style="s2">been tormenting her.</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.743" end="01:18:36.543" style="s2">This ends now.</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.943" end="01:18:39.143" style="s2">I&#39;m divorcing you right now.</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.543" end="01:18:43.043" style="s2">You&#39;ll walk away with nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.143" end="01:18:43.043" style="s2">I never want to see either of you again.</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.943" end="01:18:47.143" style="s2">You can keep living in the house my</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.343" end="01:18:48.843" style="s2">parents left me.</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.143" end="01:18:51.043" style="s2">As for the shares,</p>
<p begin="01:18:48.843" end="01:18:52.643" style="s2">give them to my husband.</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.043" end="01:18:54.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To me?</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.643" end="01:18:55.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What you think you can take my shares</p>
<p begin="01:18:54.043" end="01:18:56.843" style="s2">and then betray me?</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.343" end="01:19:00.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wouldn&#39;t dare.</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.843" end="01:19:03.843" style="s2">My wife already owns my heart and soul.</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.743" end="01:19:06.543" style="s2">Let&#39;s keep the shares in her name, too.</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.843" end="01:19:07.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What am I going to do with you?</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.543" end="01:19:10.243" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.643" end="01:19:10.243" style="s2">Have it your way.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.643" end="01:19:25.743" style="s2">I&#39;m X,</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.943" end="01:19:25.743" style="s2">the mystery genius on the Nova forum.</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.843" end="01:19:31.543" style="s2">I wrote every paper on that forum.</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.543" end="01:19:35.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; X?</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.943" end="01:19:37.843" style="s2">The one who publishes all that technical</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.943" end="01:19:39.844" style="s2">research for free?</p>
<p begin="01:19:37.843" end="01:19:42.744" style="s2">If Mrs. Gray is X,</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.844" end="01:19:42.744" style="s2">then our company could</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.070" end="01:19:52.090" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.644" end="01:19:56.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is my account dashboard on the Nova</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.344" end="01:19:59.045" style="s2">forum.</p>
<p begin="01:19:56.445" end="01:20:01.744" style="s2">My account, my papers.</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.045" end="01:20:03.744" style="s2">When I sent the company my latest paper,</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.744" end="01:20:05.945" style="s2">I wanted to prove my worth.</p>
<p begin="01:20:03.744" end="01:20:08.244" style="s2">But then someone decided [music]</p>
<p begin="01:20:05.945" end="01:20:10.344" style="s2">to hand over her shares to a stranger</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.244" end="01:20:13.045" style="s2">she just found.</p>
<p begin="01:20:10.344" end="01:20:15.945" style="s2">I lost all faith in this company.</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.045" end="01:20:15.945" style="s2">That&#39;s why I withdraw it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:18.844" end="01:20:22.244" style="s2">Now [snorts] it should be obvious</p>
<p begin="01:20:20.744" end="01:20:24.844" style="s2">who deserves to be the second largest</p>
<p begin="01:20:22.244" end="01:20:24.844" style="s2">shareholder.</p>
<p begin="01:20:26.750" end="01:20:32.844" style="s2">[music] Know your place, Layla.</p>
<p begin="01:20:29.344" end="01:20:32.844" style="s2">You&#39;re a construction day laborer</p>
<p begin="01:20:33.144" end="01:20:36.945" style="s2">who got into Gray Tech</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.945" end="01:20:39.144" style="s2">by sucking up to Galen.</p>
<p begin="01:20:36.945" end="01:20:40.744" style="s2">I&#39;m X.</p>
<p begin="01:20:39.144" end="01:20:43.144" style="s2">I can give this company</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.744" end="01:20:44.945" style="s2">the core technology it needs.</p>
<p begin="01:20:43.144" end="01:20:45.945" style="s2">If you&#39;re smart, you&#39;ll give up those</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.945" end="01:20:48.644" style="s2">shares.</p>
<p begin="01:20:45.945" end="01:20:50.344" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t care less about the shares.</p>
<p begin="01:20:48.644" end="01:20:51.945" style="s2">But Paige has made Galen suffer long</p>
<p begin="01:20:50.344" end="01:20:53.344" style="s2">enough.</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.945" end="01:20:55.545" style="s2">He wants to take back everything that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:20:53.344" end="01:20:58.545" style="s2">his. And for his sake,</p>
<p begin="01:20:55.545" end="01:20:58.545" style="s2">I&#39;m not backing down.</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.244" end="01:21:09.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Mrs. Gray really is X,</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.144" end="01:21:10.844" style="s2">she brings far more to the table</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.644" end="01:21:13.244" style="s2">than an ordinary shareholder.</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.844" end="01:21:15.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. X&#39;s research has saved several</p>
<p begin="01:21:13.244" end="01:21:15.945" style="s2">tech companies.</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.144" end="01:21:20.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re both your daughters,</p>
<p begin="01:21:18.144" end="01:21:22.945" style="s2">but one of them is X.</p>
<p begin="01:21:20.344" end="01:21:24.945" style="s2">And that makes her far more valuable to</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.945" end="01:21:25.945" style="s2">the company&#39;s future.</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.945" end="01:21:28.144" style="s2">Dorothy,</p>
<p begin="01:21:25.945" end="01:21:29.244" style="s2">think this through.</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.144" end="01:21:31.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.244" end="01:21:31.844" style="s2">I&#39;ve decided.</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.244" end="01:21:42.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry to interrupt, Mrs. Gray.</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.545" end="01:21:43.146" style="s2">I&#39;ve just learned that someone at Grey</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.046" end="01:21:45.345" style="s2">Tech</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.146" end="01:21:48.345" style="s2">is pretending to be X and using that</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.345" end="01:21:48.345" style="s2">name to con people.</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.345" end="01:21:56.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell them I&#39;m X.</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.745" end="01:22:01.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re X?</p>
<p begin="01:21:58.745" end="01:22:04.146" style="s2">Then you must know who founded</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.245" end="01:22:04.146" style="s2">the Nova Forum.</p>
<p begin="01:22:08.276" end="01:22:10.946" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:22:08.946" end="01:22:13.245" style="s2">The Nova Forum was founded</p>
<p begin="01:22:10.946" end="01:22:16.046" style="s2">by Anastasia Sterling, head of the</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.245" end="01:22:16.046" style="s2">Sterling family.</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.146" end="01:22:23.046" style="s2">When she detected</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.845" end="01:22:23.046" style="s2">a suspicious login on X&#39;s account,</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.446" end="01:22:25.845" style="s2">she immediately reset the password</p>
<p begin="01:22:24.652" end="01:22:28.446" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.845" end="01:22:31.546" style="s2">and sent the new one</p>
<p begin="01:22:28.446" end="01:22:31.546" style="s2">to the real X&#39;s phone.</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.345" end="01:22:46.345" style="s2">Miss Grey, it&#39;s time</p>
<p begin="01:22:43.345" end="01:22:46.345" style="s2">to drop the act.</p>
<p begin="01:22:48.146" end="01:22:53.046" style="s2">Anastasia Sterling has remotely traced</p>
<p begin="01:22:50.146" end="01:22:55.345" style="s2">every suspicious login.</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.046" end="01:22:57.546" style="s2">Over the past week, every IP address</p>
<p begin="01:22:55.345" end="01:22:59.646" style="s2">used to try to access X&#39;s account other</p>
<p begin="01:22:57.546" end="01:23:02.745" style="s2">than Lila&#39;s phone has been traced back</p>
<p begin="01:22:59.646" end="01:23:02.745" style="s2">to your personal computer.</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.745" end="01:23:08.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning everyone. I&#39;m Anastasia</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.745" end="01:23:11.245" style="s2">Sterling, head of the Sterling family</p>
<p begin="01:23:08.745" end="01:23:14.546" style="s2">and founder of the Nova Forum.</p>
<p begin="01:23:11.245" end="01:23:16.646" style="s2">It&#39;s an honor to meet you Mrs. Sterling.</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.546" end="01:23:19.245" style="s2">I&#39;m here to make one thing clear. Lila</p>
<p begin="01:23:16.646" end="01:23:22.046" style="s2">Anderson is X. I&#39;ve known her since she</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.245" end="01:23:23.245" style="s2">was an underclassman at MIT</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.046" end="01:23:25.046" style="s2">and I couldn&#39;t be prouder of her.</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.245" end="01:23:27.646" style="s2">Extraordinary.</p>
<p begin="01:23:25.046" end="01:23:29.046" style="s2">Every paper was written by her.</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.646" end="01:23:31.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anastasia,</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.046" end="01:23:33.446" style="s2">you&#39;re giving me far too much credit.</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.245" end="01:23:35.745" style="s2">I&#39;ve had a few small successes,</p>
<p begin="01:23:33.446" end="01:23:37.546" style="s2">nothing that impressive.</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.745" end="01:23:39.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You haven&#39;t changed.</p>
<p begin="01:23:37.546" end="01:23:40.845" style="s2">Still hiding what you can do.</p>
<p begin="01:23:39.546" end="01:23:41.946" style="s2">That&#39;s how people end up walking all</p>
<p begin="01:23:40.845" end="01:23:44.847" style="s2">over you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.946" end="01:23:46.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anastasia Sterling, Lila is my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.847" end="01:23:47.947" style="s2">I&#39;ll protect her.</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.147" end="01:23:50.147" style="s2">I won&#39;t let anyone push her around.</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.947" end="01:23:52.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I trust Lila&#39;s judgment.</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.147" end="01:23:53.947" style="s2">Come visit us in Europe sometime.</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.347" end="01:23:56.047" style="s2">You&#39;ll be my guests.</p>
<p begin="01:23:53.947" end="01:23:58.747" style="s2">As for Ms. Gray,</p>
<p begin="01:23:56.047" end="01:24:00.147" style="s2">she stole access to X&#39;s account, changed</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.747" end="01:24:03.147" style="s2">the password,</p>
<p begin="01:24:00.147" end="01:24:04.947" style="s2">and tried to pass herself off as X.</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.147" end="01:24:08.747" style="s2">The Sterling family has turned all the</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.947" end="01:24:08.747" style="s2">evidence over to our legal team.</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.047" end="01:24:21.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was never trying to hide anything.</p>
<p begin="01:24:18.547" end="01:24:21.747" style="s2">I just don&#39;t like showing off.</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.947" end="01:24:29.447" style="s2">Losing you is the greatest regret of my</p>
<p begin="01:24:27.947" end="01:24:32.147" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.447" end="01:24:34.247" style="s2">But today, all I want to say is</p>
<p begin="01:24:32.147" end="01:24:36.147" style="s2">I&#39;m proud of you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.247" end="01:24:37.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you really are X?</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.147" end="01:24:40.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I just did what I love.</p>
<p begin="01:24:37.947" end="01:24:42.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m formally transferring my entire 30%</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.447" end="01:24:46.847" style="s2">stake to my biological daughter, Lila</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.747" end="01:24:46.847" style="s2">Anderson, effective immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:24:52.147" end="01:24:55.347" style="s2">She is never to set foot in this company</p>
<p begin="01:24:54.147" end="01:24:56.947" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.347" end="01:24:58.447" style="s2">As for Lawrence Miller&#39;s years of</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.947" end="01:25:00.047" style="s2">embezzlement,</p>
<p begin="01:24:58.447" end="01:25:02.547" style="s2">I&#39;m turning the matter over to our legal</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.047" end="01:25:02.547" style="s2">department.</p>
<p begin="01:25:04.647" end="01:25:09.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard X was here. Where?</p>
<p begin="01:25:07.347" end="01:25:11.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That genius you worship</p>
<p begin="01:25:09.147" end="01:25:14.547" style="s2">has been right beside you all this time.</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.347" end="01:25:16.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Lila. Lila is X? No way.</p>
<p begin="01:25:14.547" end="01:25:18.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you before,</p>
<p begin="01:25:16.147" end="01:25:20.947" style="s2">X is just an ordinary person. Nothing</p>
<p begin="01:25:18.547" end="01:25:20.947" style="s2">special.</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.947" end="01:25:28.247" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry for the way</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.747" end="01:25:30.147" style="s2">I&#39;ve treated you both all these years</p>
<p begin="01:25:28.247" end="01:25:31.947" style="s2">and I&#39;ve wronged Lila even more.</p>
<p begin="01:25:30.147" end="01:25:33.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s done is done.</p>
<p begin="01:25:31.947" end="01:25:36.647" style="s2">Lila&#39;s back with you now.</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.947" end="01:25:36.647" style="s2">That&#39;s what matters.</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.879" end="01:25:39.899" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.547" end="01:25:46.047" style="s2">This is Lila&#39;s first board meeting. As</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.947" end="01:25:47.749" style="s2">our second largest shareholder,</p>
<p begin="01:25:46.047" end="01:25:48.649" style="s2">she used to do odd jobs on construction</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.749" end="01:25:50.249" style="s2">sites.</p>
<p begin="01:25:48.649" end="01:25:51.948" style="s2">Is she really ready</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.249" end="01:25:54.549" style="s2">for a role like this?</p>
<p begin="01:25:51.948" end="01:25:57.049" style="s2">Who knows? Being ex is one thing.</p>
<p begin="01:25:54.549" end="01:25:58.549" style="s2">Running a business is another.</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.049" end="01:26:01.349" style="s2">Let&#39;s get started.</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.549" end="01:26:03.549" style="s2">Miss Anderson, since your ex, why don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:26:01.349" end="01:26:07.349" style="s2">you tell us how we should optimize our</p>
<p begin="01:26:03.549" end="01:26:07.349" style="s2">new product&#39;s underlying architecture?</p>
<p begin="01:26:17.448" end="01:26:22.549" style="s2">Miss Anderson, I owe you</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.349" end="01:26:22.549" style="s2">an apology for doubting you.</p>
<p begin="01:26:33.448" end="01:26:36.149" style="s2">I had no idea my wife was this</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.849" end="01:26:38.948" style="s2">impressive.</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.149" end="01:26:40.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve still got work to do.</p>
<p begin="01:26:38.948" end="01:26:43.749" style="s2">Mom put her faith in me.</p>
<p begin="01:26:40.948" end="01:26:43.749" style="s2">I can&#39;t let her down.</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.249" end="01:26:54.549" style="s2">Dad, I&#39;ll be back.</p>
<p begin="01:26:52.649" end="01:26:55.849" style="s2">And I&#39;ll make them pay. Everything we</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.549" end="01:26:58.349" style="s2">lost today,</p>
<p begin="01:26:55.849" end="01:26:59.649" style="s2">I&#39;ll take back twice over.</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.349" end="01:27:01.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="01:26:59.649" end="01:27:04.948" style="s2">If Gaylen and Lyla think this is enough</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.948" end="01:27:06.649" style="s2">to beat us, they&#39;re dreaming.</p>
<p begin="01:27:04.948" end="01:27:08.349" style="s2">Once we get to Europe,</p>
<p begin="01:27:06.649" end="01:27:10.749" style="s2">we&#39;ll be back on top.</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.349" end="01:27:13.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, Julian gave us this chance. We</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.749" end="01:27:13.849" style="s2">can&#39;t let it slip away.</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.649" end="01:27:19.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The head of the Sterling family</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.849" end="01:27:20.749" style="s2">promised me a chance to rise higher in</p>
<p begin="01:27:19.149" end="01:27:22.349" style="s2">my family.</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.749" end="01:27:25.249" style="s2">All I have to do</p>
<p begin="01:27:22.349" end="01:27:28.149" style="s2">is make those two bastards pay so dearly</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.249" end="01:27:28.149" style="s2">they never recover.</p>
<p begin="01:27:30.849" end="01:27:35.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lyla, I&#39;m so proud of you.</p>
<p begin="01:27:33.649" end="01:27:38.649" style="s2">That little girl who used to save up</p>
<p begin="01:27:35.849" end="01:27:42.149" style="s2">meal tickets in our cafeteria has become</p>
<p begin="01:27:38.649" end="01:27:44.448" style="s2">someone we can all look up to.</p>
<p begin="01:27:42.149" end="01:27:46.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without this home and you,</p>
<p begin="01:27:44.448" end="01:27:47.749" style="s2">Sister Margaret, I might not be alive</p>
<p begin="01:27:46.149" end="01:27:49.550" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="01:27:47.749" end="01:27:51.550" style="s2">I hope this place can help more kids</p>
<p begin="01:27:49.550" end="01:27:52.750" style="s2">like me.</p>
<p begin="01:27:51.550" end="01:27:55.650" style="s2">Give all those children out on the</p>
<p begin="01:27:52.750" end="01:27:55.650" style="s2">streets a home.</p>
<p begin="01:28:00.550" end="01:28:04.350" style="s2">This is my first time</p>
<p begin="01:28:02.350" end="01:28:06.750" style="s2">seeing X in person.</p>
<p begin="01:28:04.350" end="01:28:08.650" style="s2">I heard she used to scrape by doing odd</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.750" end="01:28:09.750" style="s2">jobs. What she&#39;s accomplished is</p>
<p begin="01:28:08.650" end="01:28:12.150" style="s2">incredible.</p>
<p begin="01:28:09.750" end="01:28:13.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely. X&#39;s story is the stuff of</p>
<p begin="01:28:12.150" end="01:28:15.550" style="s2">legends.</p>
<p begin="01:28:13.550" end="01:28:17.250" style="s2">Galen must be the luckiest man alive to</p>
<p begin="01:28:15.550" end="01:28:19.550" style="s2">have married her.</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.250" end="01:28:21.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you all for coming.</p>
<p begin="01:28:19.550" end="01:28:25.050" style="s2">Today I&#39;d like to introduce Gray Tech&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:28:21.550" end="01:28:25.050" style="s2">next generation AI system.</p>
<p begin="01:28:25.950" end="01:28:30.801" style="s2">We&#39;re licensing its core architecture to</p>
<p begin="01:28:27.550" end="01:28:32.821" style="s2">developers worldwide free of charge.</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.801" end="01:28:32.821" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.050" end="01:28:37.650" style="s2">Gray Tech is going to build the world&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:28:35.050" end="01:28:39.950" style="s2">largest open source AI community. We</p>
<p begin="01:28:37.650" end="01:28:42.350" style="s2">have one goal, break the monopoly on</p>
<p begin="01:28:39.950" end="01:28:46.850" style="s2">computing power and give everyday people</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.350" end="01:28:46.850" style="s2">equal access to the most advanced AI.</p>
<p begin="01:28:49.141" end="01:28:51.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:28:51.350" end="01:28:56.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I really misjudged her.</p>
<p begin="01:28:53.850" end="01:28:58.150" style="s2">I let that kind of talent slip away.</p>
<p begin="01:28:56.450" end="01:29:00.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t misjudge her, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:28:58.150" end="01:29:01.750" style="s2">Nyla just keeps a low profile.</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.350" end="01:29:03.350" style="s2">Who could have guessed a woman working</p>
<p begin="01:29:01.750" end="01:29:04.850" style="s2">odd jobs</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.350" end="01:29:07.350" style="s2">was the world&#39;s most elusive tech</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.850" end="01:29:07.350" style="s2">genius.</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.650" end="01:29:11.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, it&#39;s done. [music] Just as you</p>
<p begin="01:29:09.450" end="01:29:12.950" style="s2">asked. Paige and Lawrence were taken</p>
<p begin="01:29:11.350" end="01:29:14.550" style="s2">straight to the slums when they got off</p>
<p begin="01:29:12.950" end="01:29:17.750" style="s2">the plane.</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.550" end="01:29:17.750" style="s2">They&#39;ll never recover from this.</p>
<p begin="01:29:20.250" end="01:29:24.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you all for joining us tonight. I</p>
<p begin="01:29:22.450" end="01:29:26.950" style="s2">have two announcements.</p>
<p begin="01:29:24.250" end="01:29:28.750" style="s2">First, I&#39;m officially retiring. Gail</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.950" end="01:29:30.406" style="s2">Gray will take over as chairman of Gray</p>
<p begin="01:29:28.750" end="01:29:31.350" style="s2">Tech.</p>
<p begin="01:29:30.406" end="01:29:34.450" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="01:29:31.350" end="01:29:37.350" style="s2">Second, I&#39;m appointing Lyla Anderson as</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.450" end="01:29:39.050" style="s2">Gray Tech&#39;s Chief Technology Officer.</p>
<p begin="01:29:37.350" end="01:29:40.850" style="s2">She&#39;s my daughter and she&#39;s also X</p>
<p begin="01:29:39.050" end="01:29:43.150" style="s2">herself. I believe that under her</p>
<p begin="01:29:40.850" end="01:29:46.150" style="s2">leadership Gray Tech will lead the way</p>
<p begin="01:29:43.150" end="01:29:46.150" style="s2">into a new era.</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.750" end="01:29:51.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The best decision I ever made</p>
<p begin="01:29:49.950" end="01:29:53.951" style="s2">was asking a girl in Union Square to</p>
<p begin="01:29:51.451" end="01:29:53.951" style="s2">marry me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.052" end="01:29:56.851" style="s2">That girl pressed this coin into my</p>
<p begin="01:29:55.552" end="01:29:58.151" style="s2">hand.</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.851" end="01:29:59.751" style="s2">She said she wanted to share half her</p>
<p begin="01:29:58.151" end="01:30:01.052" style="s2">luck with me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:59.751" end="01:30:04.251" style="s2">Right then I knew she was someone I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="01:30:01.052" end="01:30:04.251" style="s2">spend my life protecting.</p>
<p begin="01:30:04.751" end="01:30:08.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I gave you half my luck that day. Gave</p>
<p begin="01:30:06.552" end="01:30:09.851" style="s2">me all of yours.</p>
<p begin="01:30:08.351" end="01:30:11.151" style="s2">Being your wife is the luckiest thing</p>
<p begin="01:30:09.851" end="01:30:11.951" style="s2">that&#39;s ever happened to me.</p>
<p begin="01:30:11.151" end="01:30:14.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:30:11.951" end="01:30:15.751" style="s2">I&#39;m the lucky one. I got to marry you.</p>
<p begin="01:30:14.251" end="01:30:18.151" style="s2">Layla, I love you. You&#39;re my whole</p>
<p begin="01:30:15.751" end="01:30:18.151" style="s2">world.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
